<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">2 SHERIANAW</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 SHERIANAW</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sh</para>
  <para style="mt">2 SHERIANAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Sherianaw Uk Ningnaw</char> tuh <char style="bk">Sherianaw Uk Kheitnaw</char> te piade athua. A hopaw tuh Solomon uknaw kong, Solomon ccapaw Rehoboam a uk lyaze Jeroboam cciakhaenaw te Thahlang Peenaw (Israel ram) nynh rhawtho zah a phiakuh hae, te alia lang e Judah peenaw kong kha ho zah BC 586 kya Jerusalem a ronaw cia a ho.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Solomon uknaw 1.1—9.31</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Atakaw lya-e kum hae 1.1-17</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Beikinn saknaw 2.1—7.10</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Nyalang e kum hae 7.11—9.31</para>
  <para style="io1">Thahlang e phin hae nynh dounaw 10.1-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah siapharan hae 11.1—36.12</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem ronaw 36.13-23</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon nynh Hawnaw A Ngia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 3:1-15">1Si 3.1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David ccapaw Solomon tuh a peenaw lungkhu kya tynkaring lan a um; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia tuh a kya um zah amaw kha myarya a lesaepaw lang a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon nynh Israel hae balyn, ccungccaw athong uktu te aza uktu rhawbawi hae, byapiatu hae, Israel hae balyn kya-e cciakhaetu balyn, puizia raveih kya-e lu hae kha a ko hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon te a kya pumkuh hae paw balyn tuh Gibeon kya umpaw ahangpaw hmin langkhe a cceih hae; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh ramkaw kya a sakpaw Pachia kya-e tungkunaw bu tuh tuin kya a um. <verse number="4" style="v" />(Thuasalama Pachia thingkua kha tuh David nynh a paccynpyanaw hmin, Jerusalem kya a sakpyapaw bu kalan khe David nynh Kiriath-jearim kyate phe a cciakhae vae.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:1-17">2Sa 6.1-17</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:5-14">1Sh 13.5-14</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:1">15.25—16.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Hur ccapaw Uri a ccapaw Bezalel nynh a raepaw sohin silawhang tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikbu malang khe a um. Tukeiccuze Solomon te ccungccaw zapi hae nynh tuh-e silawhang kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:1-7">Exo 38.1-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tungkunaw bu kya, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang umpaw sohin silawhang kalan khe Solomon nynh cceihthung zah, tuh-e silawhang vawlan khe maee-ute silawnaw thong kheit kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e khuazi khe Pachia tuh Solomon kalan yn langkuh zah, “Pawmou kae pya cih, yn ngiakuh,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Solomon nynh Pachia kha, “Ka paaw David kya myarya lepaw te atynpaw sungsahnaw kha na langsakuh zah, amaw ccelang kae hynh siapharan lang nae khang vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia, ka paaw David kya bya na kinpyakupaw kha atu beih ccingsah tua, pawccecize kae hynh laenoi zeih alungpaw ccungccaw hae kya siapharan lang nae khang vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:16">Gen 13.16</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:14">28.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae nynh e ccungccaw hae malang ka pou ka tee kho nawlan hawnaw te nynaw kha beih yn pya, pawccecize myarya lungpaw hynh-e na ccungccaw hae hynh hum nynh mou a uk kho cih hae?” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pachia nynh Solomon kha, “E hynh na thinlung kya um zah, nang nynh hoirumnaw, sisua te sawtuanaw kha thuasah, na rhaw hae hiinnaw kha thuasah, hiinshe saenaw kha heize thuasah ngiaku leite, siapharan lang kae nungnaw ka ccungccaw hae uk kho nawlan, namaw hanlan hawnaw te nynaw kha nae ngiaku keiccuze, <verse number="12" style="v" />hawnaw te nynaw kha kae pya. Nang na mawze a la um vae hae paw siapharan hae te nang koute a um cih hae paw siapharan hae lu kheit nynh san a hoi boi lei hae paw hoirumnaw, sisua te sawtuanaw kha mah kae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Solomon tuh Gibeon kya umpaw ahangpaw hmin kya umpaw, tungkunaw bu kyate Jerusalem lang a cceih. Te Israel ram kha a uk.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Rhawkaw hae te Kungkunaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:26-29">1Si 10.26-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomon nynh marangle hae te marang rhawkaw hae kha a pum hae; aning nynh marangle thong kheit za pali te marang rhawkaw thong haw lae ning kha hoi zah, tuh-e hae tuh marangle khua hae kya te Jerusalem khua siapharan kyakhe a nung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:26">1Si 4.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Jerusalem khua khe sui te ngun kha lungpyng zeih lungsah zah, sidar thing kha Shefelah kya umpaw thaeku ku zeih a lungsah. <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon kya-e marang hae tuh Izip te Kue langte teekhaepaw nynh thua; siapharan a kungkutu hae nynh amee pyate Kue kya-e kha a re hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Deu 17.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Izip ram kya-e marangle ccangkheit kha ngun shekel za taruh te, marang sa kheit kha za kheit sung pangaw te a re hae; tuhcite Hit siapharan hae te Siria siapharan hae balyn kalan khe a zua pathy hae.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Sak lan Paccynnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 5:1-18">1Si 5.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min hanlan beikinn sak lan te amaw hanlan siapharan inn sak lan a paccynku. <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon nynh uccaw phutu lang ccungccaw thong sung sari, muaram kya lung-awtu lang thong sung tarya, tuh-e hae a dopahtu lang thong thum za taruh kha a synria hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Tair Siapharan Huram te Hokheihnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon nynh Tair siapharan Huram kha byataw zah: “Ka paaw David te na la ccuepekuh oh zah a umnaw lanpaw inn a sakku nawlan sidar thing na la pya hawte kae mah beih yn pyabua. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia min hanlan inn sak lan atu ka paccynkuh; tuh-e inn tuh Israel hae nynh zungzae cyi lante kawpya athua hawte, Pachia malang mynkhuhpaw kha maee-u nawlan thuasah, nungpyapaw sanlou kha tyty pya nawlan thuasah, awkhua te zete, sabbath nin hae te sawpaw sah thawpaw nin, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kya-e accyh khyapaw poi nin hae kya maee-ute silawnaw rae nawlan thuasah amaw kalan ap lanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka Pachia tuh ccangpaw pachia hae laeze a lesaehua keiccuze ka sak cih paw inn tuh ale cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama vaawlang, ahang huaccepaw vaawlang nynh heize amaw kha accawng khyh keiccuze, hum nynh mou inn kha a sakpah kho cih? Amaw malang silawnaw raepyanawpaw inn laelan, ccangpaw inn kha sakpya lan ciate kae tuh hummou ka thua?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1Si 8.27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 6:18">2Sh 6.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu ka paaw David nynh la bawm hae zah Judah ram te Jerusalem kya kamaw kya umpaw mih kuihhae hoy hae paw ryte ryalawkheih khylan, sui, ngun, sohin, sivaw, sephaphuhpaw boei, asepaw boei te meizong boei ryalawnaw kya a kuihhae hoypaw, karynte ccaw mah a zeithyapaw lu kheit kha ka kalan yn sawpah. <verse number="8" style="v" />Sidar thing, maeccaw thing te algum thing kha mah Lebanon kyate yn ky, pawccecize na ryalahtu hae nynh Lebanon e thing a awthya hae cipaw ka ny. Ka ryalahtu hae tuh na ryalahtu hae ryte <verse number="9" style="v" />thing a-awkuhpaw patae kha yn paccynpah cih hae, pawccecize ka sak cih paw inn tuh myarya le zah ngaeangthua lan umpaw inn athua cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thing-awtu hae na ryalahtu hae kha chanvuih ccangphaw kor thong kuin, barli kor thong kuin, misutui bath thong kuin te chitui bath thong kuin kha ka pya cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh Tair siapharan Huram nynh Solomon kha ccaw te leih zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw hae kha a sungsah hae keiccuze nang kha siapharan lang ae khang,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Huram nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang beikinn te amaw elang siapharan inn saknaw hanlan tuathyanaw te nythyanaw a hoipaw ccapaw kha David siapharan a pyatu, vaaw te lae a raetu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah. <verse number="13" style="v" />“Atu kya nythyanaw hoi zah a kuihhae hoypaw Huram-abi hynh kae ky, <verse number="14" style="v" />aning tuh Dan phin nopinung lu kheit ccapaw thua zah, a paaw tuh Tair ccungccaw nynh thua. Aning tuh sui, ngun, sohin, sivaw, lung, thing, sephaphuhpaw boei, meizong boei, asepaw boei te nebaleihpaw laaw te kuakuhpaw boei rya kha law khylan a ccangkuhpaw thua zah, karynte ccawzeipaw rya aphuinphuin balyn te muinsan raenaw miakaw kyakhe na ccungccaw hae kuihhae hoy hae paw, na paaw David ka bawipaw ccungccaw hae kuihhae hoy hae paw ryte rya a lahkheih cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka bawipaw nynh na ho thyhte chanvuih, barli, chitui te misutui hae tuh na ryalahtu hae hynh la ky hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaening nynh na pekipaw thing miakaw kha Lebanon kya kae ngepah cih zah rili kyate Joppa khua lang phum te kae thah cih zah nang nynh Jerusalem khua lang na la phu cih,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />A paaw David nynh Israel ram kya umpaw ramccang hae balyn kha milu ccazing a lah koute Solomon nynh ccazing lah zah, cciing kheit sung pangaw thong thum za taruh a um hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin laku e thong sung sari kha uccaw phutu lang, thong sung tarya kha muaram kya lung-awtu lang, thong thum za taruh kha ryalaw dopahtu lang a nung hae.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon nynh Beikinn A Sak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem khua kya Moriah Mua, a paaw David kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a langpyakunaw, David nynh a paccynnaw hmin, Jebus ccungccaw Ornan kya-e huimin kyakhe Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha a sak takaw vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Gen 22.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Ram a uknaw kum palinaw, sawpaw sah ningnaw, nin ning nin khe inn kha a sak takaw vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachia inn saknaw hanlan Solomon nynh a toupaw tuh hynhte nynh thua: inn tuh tounawpaw dong arynpaw te dong sung taruh sae zah dong kuin ako. <verse number="4" style="v" />Beikinn akhaanpi malang umpaw tee takawnaw khaan tuh beikinn ako thyhte dong kuin sae zah, za kheit dong kuin ahang. Alungkhu langte sui ccipaw te a thei. <verse number="5" style="v" />Akhaanpi kha maeccaw thingphe te aring popo ring zah, sui ccipaw te a thei, avawlan khe ungcci ku te sivawrui te a ccaan. <verse number="6" style="v" />Inn kha aphutepaw lung te a ccaan. Sui tuh Parvaim sui nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhcite inn a thingccaw hae, a thuakaw-ua hae, a pang hae, a thuakaw hae kha sui te ccaan hae zah, pang hae kyakhe cherubim zuh hae kha karynte a soi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmin thyaa huaccepaw tuh inn ako thyhte asaepaw dong kuin, akopaw dong kuin te rae zah, sui ccipaw talent za taruh te a thei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:33-34">Exo 26.33-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Thingkhia lang mangpaw sui tuh shekel sung pangaw ari. Avawlan khaan hae kha sui te a thei.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmin thyaa huaccepaw kyakhe cherubim ccangning muinsan kha rae zah sui te a thei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-20">Exo 25.18-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherubim hae kya-e mih sake hae nynh dong kuin cia a daw hae: cherub ccangkheit kya-e a sake ccangkheit tuh dong pangaw sae zah inn pang kha a tung, te dong pangaw asaepaw ccangpaw a sake tuh ccangpaw cherub sake te a tungkuh hae; <verse number="12" style="v" />e cherub ccangkheit kya-e dong pangaw asaepaw a sake ccangkheit nynh inn pang kha a tung, te dong pangaw asae buapaw ccangpaw a sake tuh masaty e cherub sake khate a tungkuh hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />E cherubim hae kya-e mih sake hae tuh dong kuin cia a daw hae; cherubim hae tuh mih ccu te thadyn hae zah akhaanpi langkhe mih mae a hawi hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Solomon nynh zokhawpaw boei kha meizong, sephaphuhpaw, asepaw boeisah, nebaleihpaw laaw te kuakuhpaw khate rae zah, tuh-e hae kyakhe cherubim zuh kha a soi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Exo 26.31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Inn malang khe sung thum dong pangaw ahangpaw tungpi ccangning kha rae zah, tung dung raveih khe dong pangaw acihpaw tunglukhung a um. <verse number="16" style="v" />Akhelekuhpaw sivawrui hae kha rae zah, tung dung hae kyakhe a nung; te ccalee thae za kheit kha tuh-e sivawrui kya a raebia. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e tungpi hae tuh inn malang khe voilang tung kheit, ranglang tung kheit bing zah, ranglang e tung tuh Jakhin ci zah voilang e tung tuh Boaz a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Uccaw hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 7:23-51">1Si 7.23-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon nynh asaepaw dong kuin, akopaw dong kuin te ahangpaw dong haw acihpaw sohin silawhang ccangkheit a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-2">Exo 27.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Te sohin tuikua kha apyng lante rae zah, voikheih lang arae te voikheih lang arae tuh dung haw sawkuh zah, dung pangaw ahang. Po voilu lante tou lanze dung sung thum acih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuikua arae zakaw khe po voilu lante dong kheit ze tui-ung ccanghaw ccite, tui-ung tang tangning kha tuikua po voilu lan sohin te a laee. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e tuikua tuh tangnuapaw sa haw lae ning vawlan khe a um, tangnuapaw hae sa thum tuh thahlang, sa thum tuh niccaw lang, sa thum tuh alia lang, sa thum tuh nithua lang a hawi hae. Tuikua tuh mih tungvaw khe um zah, alungkhu langkhe mih nulang kha a sangsah hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuikua tuh zapae thaw zah, arae tuh banang rae hawte thua zah, lili haetapaw te alokuh; tuikua tuh tui kha bath thong ning accawng. <verse number="6" style="v" />Singku nawlan pakepi ccanghaw rae zah, ccangpangaw kha ranglang khe nung zah, ccangpangaw kha voilang khe a nung. E hae lungkhu hin maee-ute silawnaw kya mangpaw uccaw hae kha a ccikan hae. Tuikua tuh ranpibawi hae nynh a singku nawlan hae paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:17-21">Exo 30.17-21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Synriaty athua vae hawte, sui maeekhuatung ccanghaw kha rae zah beikinn lungkhu, alia langsang khe ccangpangaw, thahlang sang khe ccangpangaw a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Exo 25.31-40</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccaboi kha mah ccanghaw rae zah beikinn lungkhu, ranglang sang khe ccangpangaw, voilang sang khe ccangpangaw a nung. Te sui pakepi za kheit a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Exo 25.23-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae voidu, voidu lepaw te voidu elang thuakaw hae kha rae zah, thuakaw hae kha sohin te a thei hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuikua kha inn nithua-alia lang apaki khe a nung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huram nynh ang hae, buhhawlua hae te pakepi hae kha a rae. Tuhcite Huram nynh Solomon Siapharan hanlan Pachia inn kya rya a lawpyapaw kha a lyn: <verse number="12" style="v" />tungpi ccangning, pakekhupaw hae, tungpi dung hae kya-e tunglukhung ccangning, tungpi dung hae kya umpaw tunglukhung hae bong lanpaw miabu hawte akhelekuhpaw ccangning; <verse number="13" style="v" />tungpi dung hae kya umpaw tunglukhung hae bong lanpaw miabu hawte akhelekuhpaw ccangning hae hanlan ccalee thae za pali, tuh-e miabu lopaw ccangkheit cci hanlan ccalee thae atang tang ning, <verse number="14" style="v" />thadynsahnawpaw hae, thadynsahnawpaw hae vawlan umpaw pakepi hae, <verse number="15" style="v" />tuikua ccangkheit, tuh-e tuikua kaw umpaw tangnuapaw hae sa haw lae ning kha a rae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ang hae, buhhawlua hae, phedung hae te hynh-e hae hanlan ahopaw uccaw balyn tuh Huram-abi nynh Solomon Siapharan elang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn hanlan awrarihpaw sohin te a raepya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Jordan bialae, Sukkoth te Zeredah laku anglae a umnaw hmin kyakhe siapharan nynh tuh-e hae tuh a raesah hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Solomon nynh e uccaw hae balyn hynh patae a rae keiccuze sohin tuh hohzeihmou ari cipaw ny kho um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon nynh Pachia inn kya umpaw uccaw balyn kha a rae: sui silawhang, nungpyapaw sanlou nungnawpaw ccaboi, <verse number="20" style="v" />synriaty athua vae hawte, alungkhu lang e hminthyaa malang maee aw nawlan sui ccipaw te raepaw maeekhuatung hae te mih maeeinn hae; <verse number="21" style="v" />sui ccipaw te raepaw haetapaw hae, maeeinn hae, tetakia hae; <verse number="22" style="v" />sui ccipaw te raepaw tetakia hae, pakepi hae, angsaw hae, maee-e nungnawpaw pake hae; beikinn lungkhu lang teenaw hae tuh: hmin thyaa huaccepaw kalan teenawpaw alungkhu lang e thuakaw hae te beikinn akhaanpi kya-e thuakaw hae kha sui te a rae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn hanlan rya a lawpaw balyn kha a thangsah. A paaw David nynh a hlu vae paw uccaw hae kha Solomon nynh teekhae zah Pachia inn e sisuakhaan kyakhe sui, ngun te angphe balyn kha a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:11">2Sa 8.11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 18:11">1Sh 18.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn lungkhu lang Thingkua Teekhaenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:1-9">1Si 8.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua kha Zion cikuhpaw David khua kyate poukhae khylan, Solomon nynh Israel piccan hae balyn, mih phin raveih kya-e lu hae balyn, Israel ciihan cciakhaetu hae balyn kha Jerusalem khua kya a pum hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:12-15">2Sa 6.12-15</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-28">1Sh 15.25-28</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel hae balyn tuh sawpaw sah sarinaw kya tuapaw poi kyakhe siapharan malang a pumkuh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel piccan hae balyn tuh oun thua hae zah Levi phin hae nynh thingkua kha a puih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh thingkua, tungkunaw bu te bu lungkhu umpaw athyaapaw angphe balyn kha a cciakhae thung hae; ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae nynh a cciakhae thung hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan te a malang pumkuh hae paw Israel zapi balyn tuh thingkua malang khe um hae zah, minmin nynh riatae um lei lan alungpaw tuu hae te tangnuapaw hae khate silawnaw a rae hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua kha beikinn alungkhu lang e hminthyaa kya, hmin thyaa huaccepaw kya, cherubim sake hae kaw, amaw hmin kyakhe a nung hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize cherubim hae nynh mih sake hae kha thingkua umnaw luki khe daw hae zah, thingkua te puihnawpaw ccong hae kha a dawpya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Puihnawpaw ccong hae tuh eih asae keiccuze adung kha alungkhu lang e hminthyaa malang umpaw athyaapaw hmin kyate muih kho athua; thuasalama atolang te muih kho thua khyh; atunin cia tuin kya a um hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate a pou lya hae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin ryte byakinnaw a raenaw Horeb mua kya Moses nynh a la sangpaw lungphe phe ning laelan, thingkua lungkhu kya ccangpaw pawpaw mah um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:5">Deu 10.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae tuh athyaapaw hmin kyate he a pou hae te (tuin kya umpaw ranpibawi balyn tuh a umnaw hae aphu kha peki leite, phe a thyaasakuh vae hae, <verse number="12" style="v" />te Levi phin hlawsahthya hae paw balyn, Asaf, Heman te Jeduthun, mih ccapaw hae te mih puizia hae kha nebaleihpaw laaw te kuakuhpaw boei khate ccaankuh hae zah, lanchi, tintang te tang-oi hae kha ccyngkute mungkae tu hae paw ranpibawi hae za kheit lu kuin ryte silawhang nithua langkhe a thadyn hae). <verse number="13" style="v" />Mungkae tu hae paw te hlawsahthya hae paw mih rya tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> luungnaw hlaw te thehoysahnaw hlaw kha roi kheit lante ccaesah lanpaw athua keiccuze mungkae, lanchi te ccangpaw khuakupaw uccaw hae khate,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pawccecize amaw tuh ahoy,</para>
  <para style="q2">atynpaw a sungsahnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae atyn,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysahte hlaw he a sah hae tuh, inn, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn tuh maeking te phe abeih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1Sh 16.34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">2Sh 7.3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Ezr 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Sam 100.5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 116:1">116.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136.1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jer 33.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />maeking keiccuze ranpibawi hae tuh ryalaw lan thadyn kho khyh hae; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh Pachia inn kya phe abeih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34-35">Exo 40.34-35</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Thyaasahnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:12-21">1Si 8.12-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon nynh, “Varyng zipingpaw mohnaw kya ka um cih cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="2" style="v" />A sung-epaw inn, zungzae na umnaw lanpaw hmin kha kae sakpya vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Israel zapi hae balyn tuh a thadyn lya hae khe, siapharan nynh a nulang maeleihkuh zah Israel zapi hae balyn kha hythua a pya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Solomon nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah, pawccecize ka paaw David kyakhe a mung te byakinpakuh zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-13">2Sa 7.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-12">1Sh 17.1-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha Izip ram kyate ka poukhae nin hae kyate tho zah, ka min a umnaw lanpaw inn kha sak nawlan, Israel phin hae kya-e pawpaw khua kha mah ka po khyh; ka ccungccaw Israel hae uktu lang humhung mah ka po khyh; <verse number="6" style="v" />thuasalama ka min a um nawlan Jerusalem khua kha ka po zah, ka ccungccaw Israel hae a uktu lang David kha ka po,’ cite a hopaw bya kha a kuih te a ccingsah vae. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia min hanlan inn sak lanpaw kha ka paaw David thinlung kya a la um. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka paaw David kha, ‘Ka min hanlan inn sak lan na tuaku keiccuze ahoypaw kha na cyi vae; <verse number="9" style="v" />thuasalama nang nynh inn kha na sak lan khyh, na saahkuh cih paw na ccapaw nynh ka min hanlan inn kha a sak cih,’ a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinkupaw kha a ccingsah vae; pawccecize ka paaw David hmin kya ka um vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinku thyhte, Israel bawitungkhung kya ka haung zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia min hanlan inn kha ka sak vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae ryte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a raepaw byakinnaw a umnahpaw thingkua kha tuh-e inn kya ka nung vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:22-53">1Si 8.22-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang malang, Israel zapi a pumkuh hae paw balyn muihnaw khe thadyn zah a kuih kha tharae a zo. <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon nynh asaepaw dong pangaw, akopaw dong pangaw, ahangpaw dong thum acihpaw ccaboi hangpaw ccangkheit kha rae zah voidu kya nung zah tuh-e vawlan khe a thadyn. Te Israel zapi hae balyn malang khe a ccukharutung zah vaawlang khe a kuih tharae a zothung. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, vaaw te lae kya nang ae lopaw Pachia um khyh, mih thinlung balynte namaw malang a cceih hae paw na ryalahtu hae kya atynpaw na sungsahnaw te na byakinnaw kha na tynsah, <verse number="15" style="v" />na ryalahtu ka paaw David kya na kinpyakupaw bya kha na tynsah. Thanccingte, na mung te bya na kinpakuh zah na kuih te atunin na ccingsah vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, na ryalahtu ka paaw David kyaze, ‘Nang nynh ka malang na ccia hawte, na ccaaw hae nynh ka malang ccia lan mih laanpi kha a raeringku hae zetuh, Israel bawitungkhung kya ka malang a haung cih paw na ciihan tuh dae lan khyh,’ cite bya na kinpyakupaw kha beih tynsah tua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1Si 2.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou Israel Pachia, na ryalahtu David kya na kinpyakupaw bya kha beih tynsah tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thuasalama Pachia tuh laephi vawlan ccungccaw hae kya um ccaccing vema? Vaawram te ahang huaccepaw vaawram nynh heize nang kha ae ccawng khyh, kae nynh ka sakpaw hynh-e inn thathy tuh hosyn um vae khyh!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:6">2Sh 2.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia, na ryalahtupaw nynh saw ka sangpaw te kae ngiapaw hynh yn ngaepya tua, na ryalahtupaw nynh na kalan ka siapaw te saw ka sangpaw hynh yn thaepya tua; <verse number="20" style="v" />na min nung nawlan bya na kinkunaw hmin, e inn kalan hin khuazi khuadae yn do lah, na ryalahtupaw nynh hynh-e hmin kalan hawite saw ka sangpaw hynh beih yn thaepya tua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Deu 12.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Na ryalahtupaw te na ccungccaw Israel hae nynh hynh-e hmin kalan hawite saw kae sang vae ze, kae ngiapaw kha yn thaepya tua; na umnaw vaawram te yn thaepah lah, kae seinaw kha oun ngaethya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Lukhakheit nynh ccangpaw lu kheit tungvaw a sei keiccuze thyalawsaku thua zah, e inn kya na silawhang malang poute thya a lawku ze, <verse number="23" style="v" />nang nynh vaawram te thae lah, rya yn lah lah, na ryalahtu hae hynh bya oun piatua, a seitupaw tuh a cyisahnaw kha amaw lu vawlan ccawsah lah, a dingpaw tuh a dingnaw thyhte thanenaw pya khylan thyaccousah tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na ccungccaw Israel hae nynh na tungvaw a sei hae keiccuze mih rhaw hae malang he a shung hae te, namaw kalan bua oun maekuh hae zah na min kha sawtuate, e inn kyahin namaw kalan sawsangte ae ngiaku hae ze, <verse number="25" style="v" />vaawram te thaepah hae lah, na ccungccaw Israel hae seinaw kha ngaethya hae, te minmin te mih minpaaw hae na pya hae paw ram langkhe bua kikhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Na tungvaw a sei hae keiccuze vaaw kha na khawsung zah khuaa kansah te de he na tah hae te, minmin nynh hynh-e hmin kalan hawite sawsang hae zah na min kha nawccawte mih seinaw kyate a maeleihku hae ze, <verse number="27" style="v" />vaawram te la thae lah, na ryalahtu hae te na ccungccaw Israel hae seinaw kha ngaethya hae; a zui lan hae paw laanpi hoypaw kha ccangpah hae lah, na ccungccaw hae elang rho lang na pya hae paw na ram kya khuaarawsah tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Ram lungkhu kya ccakan acci ze thuasah, shethya a thua ze thuasah, looh aphi poute ronaw, khivae keiccu looh ronaw, tungkhipaw te maccaloih keiccu looh ronaw thuasah, rhaw nynh mih khua khuakhakheit kha a koihku ze thuasah, shethya ccangkhakheit, ccinaw ccangkhakheit a um ze thuasah, <verse number="29" style="v" />na ccungccaw Israel hae nynh mih balynte thuasah, humhung nynh mah lukhakheit te thuasah mih thinlung raveih kya a teing hae paw kha nykute, e inn kalan hin mih kuih a daw hae zetuh, <verse number="30" style="v" />na umnaw vaawram te la thaepah hae, mih seinaw ngaethya hae lah bawmtua hae, a zui hae paw mih laanpi thyhte mih thinlung na ny hae paw balyn kha pyaru hae, pawccecize ccungccaw thinlung kha nang rou nynh na nyh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh kae minpaaw hae na la pya hae paw ram kya a um lungkhu hae balyn nang kha ae rih cih hae zah na laanpi kha a zui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tuhawte, na ccungccaw Israel athua leipaw ramccang hae nynh alesaepaw na min, athungpaw na kuih te na dyngpaw na kuih konglang kha a thae hae keiccuze laansawpi te yn cceih hae zah, e inn kalan hin saw a sang hae ze, <verse number="33" style="v" />na umnaw vaawram te thaepya tua hae; na ccungccaw Israel hae hawte, laephi ccungccaw balyn nynh na min ae ny nawlan hae te na raw ae ri nawlan hae thuasah, ka sakpaw hynh-e inn kyahin na min kha ko athua cipaw a ny nawlan hae thuasah ramccangpaw nynh ae ngiapaw miakaw kha cyipya tua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Na ccungccaw hae nynh mih rhaw hae kha tuk khylan a ccia vae hae ze, pawpaw laanpi kya na zuisah hae zemah, na popaw e khua kalan te na min hanlan ka sakpaw inn kalan hawite na kalan saw a sang hae ze, <verse number="35" style="v" />mih sawsangnaw te mih ngiakunaw kha vaawram te thaepah hae lah, mih ryalaw kya pankhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“A sei leipaw lu kheit san a um khyh keiccuze—minmin nynh na tungvaw sei hae zah minmin elang na thinria keiccuze rhaw hae kuih kalan na pya hae zah, minmin kha asawnaw khyhze anaenaw umpaw mih rhaw hae ram lang kyngte cciakhae athua hae ze thuasah, <verse number="37" style="v" />a cciakhaenaw hae ram kyakhe minmin nynh mih thinlung kya oun nyhthui hae zah ngaesikute a kyngtu hae ram kyakhe nang kha, ‘Kae sei vae, kae cyisei vae, ahoy leipaw rya kae lawsei vae,’ cite ae ngiaku hae ze thuasah, <verse number="38" style="v" />kyngte a cciakhaetu hae mih rhaw hae ram kyakhe mih thinlung te mih tuanaw balyn te ngaesikuh hae zah, mih minpaaw hae na pya hae paw mih ram, na popaw khua te na min hanlan ka sakpaw inn kalan hawite na kalan saw oun sang hae ze thuasah, <verse number="39" style="v" />na umnaw vaawram kyate mih sawsangnaw te mih ngiakunaw kha thaepah hae, mih ryalaw kya pankhae hae lah, na tungvaw a sei hae paw na ccungccaw hae kha ngaethya hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Pou ka Pachia, e hmin kyate atu saw ka sangpaw hynh beih muih lah, beih thaetua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, thokuh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na huhan a umnahpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">byakin thingkua rykhate</para>
  <para style="q2">na umnaw hmin lang cciatua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ranpibawi hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">khumnaw boeining kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lawkuh hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">alungzipaw na ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na hoynaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungtua sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.41-42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:8-10">Sam 132.8-10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">chitui thuh athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccungccapaw kha vua nan.</para>
  <para style="q2">Na ryalahtu David elang</para>
  <para style="q1">atynpaw na sungsahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">liathuitua,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Apnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:62-66">1Si 8.62-66</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon nynh saw a sang koute, vaawlang te maee yn ccah zah maee-ute silawnawpaw te silawnawpaw hae kha a u hae; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh beikinn kya phe abeih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:23-24">Lev 9.23-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya phe abia keiccuze ranpibawi hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang tee kho khyh hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Maee yn ccah zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh beikinn vawlan a umpaw kha Israel hae balyn nynh he a muih hae tuh, lung aphaekuhpaw vawlan khe laekhu kya bakhung hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beikte lungtuabya ho hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Amaw tuh ahoy,</para>
  <para style="q2">atynpaw a sungsahnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae atyn,” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:34">1Sh 16.34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2Sh 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Ezr 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Sam 100.5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136.1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jer 33.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te siapharan te ccungccaw hae balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe silawnaw a rae hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh tangnuapaw thong kuin lae ning te tuu cciing kheit thong kuin khate silawnaw a rae. Tuhcite siapharan te ccungccaw balyn nynh Pachia inn kha a ap hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae tuh mih umnaw hmin kya a thadyn hae; Levi phin hae mah David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thehoysah nawlan a raepaw khuakupaw uccaw hae kha khuakute thadyn hae zah David nynh rya a naw hae thyhte, “Atynpaw a sungsahnaw tuh zungzae atyn,” cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha the a hoysah hae. Minmin te arawsekunaw khe ranpibawi hae nynh mungkae tu hae zah, Israel hae balyn tuh a thadyn hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn malang umpaw voidu angaelung kha a thyaasah; Solomon nynh a raepaw sohin silawhang nynh maee-ute silawnaw, ccathae silawnaw te atho hae kha accawng khyh keiccuze tuin kyakhe maee-ute silawnaw hae te ccawkunaw silawnawpaw atho khate silawnaw a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin ccyh lyakhe Solomon nynh a kya umpaw Israel hae balyn te myarya lungpaw ccungccaw zapi hae, Hamath khua teenaw kyate Izip Vaw kyacia a um hae paw ryte nin sari lungkhu poi a tua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nin taryanaw nin khe athyaapaw pumkunaw kha a rae hae; pawccecize nin sari lungkhu silawhang apnaw rae hae zah nin sari lungkhu poi a tua hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Sawpaw sah sarinaw, nin kuin lae thum nin khe ccungccaw hae kha mih inn lang a kisah hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David, Solomon te a ccungccaw Israel hae kya a langsahkupaw hoynaw keiccuze minmin tuh lungtua lungpawte a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn te siapharan inn kha a lyn; Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya te amaw inn kya cyi lan a paccynpaw balyn kha hoyte a lyn.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon kya Pachia Bua A Langkuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Solomon kya khuazi khe langkuh zah: “Na sawsangnaw kha ka thae vae, e hmin hynh silawnaw inn lang kamaw elang ka poku vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuaa araw khyh nawlan vaawlui kha ka khaw ze thuasah, laephi kya-e looh kha ae khylan tungkhipaw hae kha kaw ka pya hae ze thuasah, ka ccungccaw hae kya shethya ka thuasah ze thuasah, <verse number="14" style="v" />ka min te ko athua hae paw ka ccungccaw hae nynh zakawsangsakute sawsang hae zah ka mae kha ccungte ahoy leipaw mih laanpi kyate a maeleihku hae zetuh, vaawlang te ka thae cih zah mih seinaw kha ngaethyate mih ram kha ka dansah cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />E hmin kya saw a sang hae paw kha ka mit nynh a muih cih zah ka naw nynh a thae cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka min tuh hein kya zungzae a um ccaw cite e inn hynh ka po zah ka thyaasah vae; ka mit te ka thinlung tuh hein kya tyty a um cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang tuh na paaw David nynh a la ccia hawte, kaw kae pyapaw balyn thyhte cyite, ka phungbya hae te ka phungzae hae kha zuite ka malang na ccia zetuh, <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Israel a uk cih paw na ciihan tuh dae lan khyh,’ cite na paaw David ryte byakinnaw ka rae hawte, na siapharan bawitungkhung tuh zungzae ka tynsah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1Si 2.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Thuasalama ccanglang na maeleihkuh oh zah nae malang ka nungpaw ka kawbya hae te ka phungbya hae kha vuate, ccangpaw pachia hae kalan na cceih oh zah na beik oh zetuh, <verse number="20" style="v" />nanning kae pya oh paw ram kyate poh kae khaee cih oh; ka min hanlan ka thyaasahpaw e inn hynh ka muihnaw kyate ka vua cih zah ccungccaw hae balyn kya phungtangbya te saryapaw lang ka tangsah cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />E inn a sung-epaw hynh a pe po a cceihpaw miakaw nynh mih ngaeangthua cih zah, ‘E ram te e inn hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawccemou hynhte a cyi?’ cite a ho cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te minmin nynh, ‘Mih minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate a poukhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha vua hae zah, ccangpaw pachia hae kha doliakute beik hae zah rya a lawpya hae keiccu nynh thua; tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e ronaw hynh mih tungvaw a thuasah,’ cite a ho cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Solomon Ryalaw hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">1Si 9.10-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn te siapharan inn kha sak zah kum kuin he aro te, <verse number="2" style="v" />Huram nynh a pyapaw khua hae kha Solomon nynh raethui zah tuin kya Israel hae kha a umsah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon nynh Hamath-zobah ram kha ccianua zah a law. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ramkaw kya Tadmor khua kha rae zah, Hamath ram kya uccaw ccakhungnaw khua hae balyn kha a rae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Khualungrua hae, koikua hae, sakoih ccong hae te akoihkuhpaw khua hae Palung Beth-horon te Alia Beth-horon khua hae kha mah a rae hae, <verse number="6" style="v" />Baalath khua, Solomon kya-e uccaw ccakhungnawpaw khua hae balyn, marangle hae hanlan khua hae, a marang rhawkaw hae hanlan khua hae te Solomon nynh Jerusalem kya, Lebanon kya te a ukpaw ram hae balyn kyakhe sak a rypaw miakaw kha a sak. <verse number="7" style="v" />Hit hae, Amor hae, Periz hae, Hiv hae te Jebus hae lungkhu e a laehy hae paw balyn, Israel ccungccaw athua lei hae paw, <verse number="8" style="v" />ram kya a laehy hae paw mih ciihan hae kya-e Israel ccungccaw hae nynh a ro lei hae paw kha— Solomon nynh nangsete ryalawsahnaw kya nung hae zah, atunin cia tuhcite a um hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae kha tuh Solomon nynh a ryalaw kya see lang mang khyh hae; minmin tuh rhawkaw hae, a kuihkaw e bawi hae, a marangle rhawkaw hae te a marang rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />E hae tuh Solomon Siapharan kuihkaw e bawi lepaw hae, ccungccaw hae tungvaw kawhoitu hae za ning sung pangaw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon nynh Faro ccanung kha David khua kyate a sakpyapaw inn kalan khe a cciakhae; pawccecize Solomon nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua a thuanaw hmin tuh athyaa keiccuze ka zu tuh Israel Siapharan David inn kya um lan ccan khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tee takawnaw akhaan malang kya a raepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang vawlan khe Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan maee-ute silawnaw kha a rae, <verse number="13" style="v" />tuh-e tuh Moses kawbya thyhte sabbath nin hae, sawpaw thawpaw hae te kum kheit ze vae thum tuapaw poi hae—ransi phing leipaw sanlou poi, lonaw poi te bu poi hanlan nin takyhte raepaw silawnaw kha leih a rae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:14-17">Exo 23.14-17</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:22-23">34.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 28:9">Nam 28.9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 29:39">29.39</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:16">Deu 16.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />A paaw David phungzae thyhte, ranpibawi hae kha mih rya raveih hanlan aphuphute ryalaw a nee hae, te Levi phin hae tuh nin takyhte law lanpaw rya thyhte, ranpibawi hae ryte thehoysahpaw rya te law lanpaw mih rya kha nee athua hae, sakoih ngawtu hae kha mah sakoih patae hanlan aphuphute rya a nee hae; pawccecize Pachia ccungccapaw David nynh tuhcite kaw a la pya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ryalaw miakaw te asekuhpaw kong thuasah, sisua hae te asekuhpaw kong thuasah siapharan nynh kaw a pya hae paw kha ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae nynh ccanglang maetawkuh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn aleihpaw bing nin kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn marya lyn athua mawlaezung, Solomon rya miakaw kha tuhcite a lyn hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Solomon tuh Edom ram kya rili kin a umpaw Eziongeber te Eloth lang a cceih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Huram nynh sanphalung hae kha tuh-e hae a do-oih hae paw a ryalahtu hae te rili kya ryalah thya hae paw ryte Solomon kalan a saw hae. Minmin tuh Solomon a ryalahtu hae ryte Ofir lang cceih hae zah, tuin kya-e sui talent za pali sung pangaw kha Solomon Siapharan kalan a phupya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sheba Siapharannung nynh Paebuanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1Si 10.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sheba siapharannung nynh Solomon a minthaannaw kha he a thae tuh, myarya rupaw byakhianaw khate syntawtua khylan yn cceih; a mikung hae patae ryte amynkhuhpaw hae te sui patae te aphutepaw lung hae aphupaw kalauh hae ryte Jerusalem lang yn cceih. Solomon kya he a thua te, a thinlung kya umpaw miakaw kha a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.1-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:42">Mat 12.42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:31">Luk 11.31</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Bya a khiapaw miakaw kha Solomon nynh a phipya; siapharan nynh a ny leipaw, a ccaesahpya kho leipaw pawpaw mah um khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Sheba siapharannung nynh Solomon a hawnaw, a sakpaw inn, <verse number="4" style="v" />a ccaboi vawlan e looh, a kuihkaw e bawi hae a umzia hae, a ryalahtu hae ryalaw synrianaw, mih boeining, a ryalahtu pise hae te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya maee-ute si a lawnaw kha he a muih tuh, a ngaeangthua zah a lung phe zo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te aning nynh siapharan kha, “Ka ram kyate ka thaepaw na ryalaw konglang te na hawnaw kong tuh akyh, <verse number="6" style="v" />thuasalama kamaw po kae thua zah ka mit te ka muih mawlaezung tuh a ho hae paw kha ka zyn khyh. Angankuh sanmah yn la hopah khyh hae; na hawnaw te na hoirumnaw tuh ka la thaepaw kha po a lawe. <verse number="7" style="v" />Na ccungccaw hae tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua hae! Nang kha palei ae do-oih hae zah na hawnaw palei a thae hae paw na ryalahtu hae tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua hae! <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tungvaw a lungrythua zah Israel bawitungkhung kya ae nungpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha zungzae sungsah zah a tynsah ry keiccuze nang nynh byading te dingnaw kha na rae nawlan minmin a uktu siapharan lang ae khang vae,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Sheba siapharannung nynh Solomon kha sui talent za kheit ccangkuin, amynkhuhpaw patae te aphutepaw lung hae kha a pya; Sheba siapharannung nynh Solomon Siapharan a pyapaw mynkhuhpaw tahawpaw ccangpaw um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Ofir khua kyate sui oun phutu hae Hiram a ryalahtu hae te Solomon a ryalahtu hae nynh algum thing patae te aphutepaw lung hae kha oun phu hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Siapharan nynh tuh-e algum thing khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn dounawpaw tung hae, siapharan inn dounawpaw tung hae te hlawsahthya hae paw elang tang-oi te tintang hae kha mah a rae hae; tuhcihawpaw algum thing tuh Judah ram kya langmawlya muih boi lan um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sheba siapharannung nynh a phupyapaw lasung hanlan Solomon Siapharan nynh a pyarupaw lasung holeite, siapharannung nynh ry zah a ngiakupaw miakaw kha mah a pya. Tukoute siapharannung tuh a ryalahtu hae ryte amaw ram lang a ki vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Sisua Patae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:14-25">1Si 10.14-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon kalan kum kheit lungkhu a teepaw sui nynh aripaw tuh talent za taruh sung taruh ccangtaruh acih, <verse number="14" style="v" />tuh-e hae apiaze kungku hae te uccaw zuatu hae nynh a teekhae hae paw a um ung; Arabia siapharan hae balyn te ram uktu bawi hae nynh Solomon kalan sui te ngun a thuakhae hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon nynh deihpaw sui te khawriaphua alepaw za ning kha rae zah, tuh-e khawriaphua ccangkheit cci elang deihpaw sui shekel za taruh cci athang. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning nynh deihpaw sui te khawriaphua za thum kha rae zah, tuh-e khawriaphua ccangkheit cci elang sui shekel za thum cci athang; tuh-e hae tuh siapharan nynh Lebanon Tuhpi Inn kya a nung hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Siapharan nynh saepanua te bawitungkhung lepaw kha mah rae zah, sui ccite a thei. <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawitungkhung tuh kaenawpaw ccusy thyh taruh um zah sui te raepaw phanah a hoi, tuh-e hae tuh bawitungkhung kya a piadekuh hae, te haungnaw voilang ranglang te kuih khangnawpaw um zah tuh-e kuih khangnawpaw pe tuin chindeih sa ning a thadyn hae, <verse number="19" style="v" />te kaenawpaw ccusy thyh taruh vawlan akin lang voilang ranglang khe chindeih sa kheit ccite sa haw lae ning a thadyn hae. Tuhcihawpaw bawitungkhung tuh teitei ram kya mah rae boi khyh hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh a nianawpaw banang balyn tuh sui thua zah, Lebanon Tuhpi Inn kya-e angphe hae balyn tuh sui ccite raepaw nynh thua hae; ccangkheit sanmah ngun um khyh, Solomon she lya tuh ngun hynh pawlangria khyh hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Siapharan kya-e sanphalung hae tuh Hiram a ryalahtu hae ryte Tarshish lang leih a cceih he hae; Tarshish sanphalung phu tuh kum thum ze vae kheit leih oun thua hae zah sui, ngun, saepanua, zuapaw hae te buatua hae kha leih oun phu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon Siapharan nynh laephi vaw e siapharan hae balyn kha hoirumnaw te hawnaw kya pong a lawe hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pachia nynh Solomon thinlung kya a pyapaw hawnaw kha thae khylan, laephi vaw e siapharan balyn tuh amaw kalan oun cceih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuh-e hae miakaw nynh sui te ngun uccaw hae, boeining hae, zunghe hae, amynkhuhpaw hae, marang hae te lann hae kha kum takyh lasung lang a ccyngpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon nynh marangle hae te marang hae hanlan marang inn thong pali, marang rhawkaw thong haw lae ning hoi zah, marangle nungnaw khua hae te Jerusalem umpaw siapharan kya a nung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:26">1Si 4.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Zufrates vaw kyate Filistin hae ram kyacia, te Izip ramri cia a um hae paw siapharan hae balyn kha a uk hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Gen 15.18</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 4:21">1Si 4.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Jerusalem khua khe ngun kha lungpyng zeih lungsah zah, sidar thing kha Shefelah kya umpaw thaeku ku zeih a lungsah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon hanlan marang hae kha Izip ram te ram takyh kyate a thuakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Deu 17.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Solomon nynh rya a lawpaw kha atakaw te athangnaw cia, profeh Nathan phungpaw ccauh, Shilon khuapaw Ahijah profeh ccauh te Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam te asekuh lante muihdaetu Iddo nynh a muihpaw vizin ccauh kyakhe a zei hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomon nynh Israel ram pynpi kha Jerusalem khua kyate kum sung pali a uk. <verse number="31" style="v" />Solomon tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah a paaw David khua kya a uu hae; te a ccapaw Rehoboam nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam kha Dounaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 12:1-20">1Si 12.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae balyn nynh Rehoboam kha siapharan lang khang khylan Shekhem khua lang a ccia hae keiccuze amaw mah a cceihbua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh he a thae tuh (pawccecize aning tuh Solomon Siapharan kyate a ccuenaw Izip ram kya nynh a um ung), Jeroboam tuh Izip ram kyate yn ki. <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel hae nynh amaw kha a kosah hae; te Jeroboam te Israel zapi balyn nynh oun cceih hae zah Rehoboam kha, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na paaw nynh phupaw ripaw kha oun phusah vae. Tukeiccuze na paaw nynh kae tungvaw rya rupaw te phupaw ripaw oun phusahpaw hynh nang nynh oun zawsahpah lah, na rya kae lawpah cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha, “Nin thum koute ka kalan bua nae cceih cih oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh Rehoboam Siapharan nynh a paaw Solomon a hiin lyaze a do-oih hae paw piccan hae kha tuanaw ngia hae zah, “E ccungccaw hae kalan khungru lanpaw bya hynh pawtemou tuanaw nae pya cih oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh amaw kha, “E ccungccaw hae hynh ngaethya na umsah hae zah mih lungrytungte bya hoypaw te na khung hae zetuh, minmin tuh na ryalahtu lang zungzae a tang cih hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama piccan hae nynh tuanaw a pya hae paw kha pawlangria khyh, amaw te ruikheih bankheih thua hae zah amaw a do-oih hae paw ccangvae hae kha tuanaw a ngia hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha, “ ‘Na paaw nynh phupaw ripaw oun phusahpaw hynh oun zawsahpya tua,’ cite yn hopah hae paw e ccungccaw hae khungru lanpaw hynh pawtemou tuanaw nae pya cih oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruikheih bankheih athua hae paw ccangvae hae nynh amaw kha, “ ‘Na paaw nynh phupaw ripaw oun phusah vae, nang nynh oun zawsahpya tua,’ cite ae hopah hae paw e ccungccaw hae hynh hynhte na khung cih hae; minmin kha, ‘Ka kuihdung taraw hynh ka paaw atae laeze athaawhua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka paaw nynh phupaw ripaw ae phusah oh, kae nynh tuh nae phupaw kha houh kae buchihpah cih oh. Ka paaw nynh ruising te ae thuihei oh, kae nynh tuh zekang te kae thuihei cih oh,’ cite na cipah cih hae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh, “Nin thumnaw nin kya ka kalan bua nae cceih cih oh,” cite a ho thyhte, Jeroboam te ccungccaw balyn tuh nin thumnaw nin khe Rehoboam kalan oun thua hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ccungccaw hae kha byarepaw te a khung hae. Piccan hae nynh tuanaw a pya hae paw kha Rehoboam Siapharan nynh pawlangria khyh; <verse number="14" style="v" />ccangvae hae nynh a pya hae paw tuanaw thyhte minmin kha, “Ka paaw nynh phupaw ripaw ae phusah oh, kae nynh tuh nae phupaw kha houh kae buchihpah cih oh; ka paaw nynh ruising te ae thuihei oh, kae nynh tuh zekang te kae thuihei cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ccungccaw hae bya kha ngae khyh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Shilon khuapaw Ahijah kha mangte Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam kya a hopaw bya kha ccingsah khylan Pachia nynh a ry keiccu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siapharan nynh kae bya hynh ngae khyh cipaw kha Israel hae balyn nynh he a muih hae tuh, ccungccaw hae nynh siapharan kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kaening nynh David kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccoupaw pawmou kae hoi?</para>
  <para style="q1">Jesse ccapaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">rho kae hoi khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Israel, nae bu kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ccarou cceih oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou David, namaw maw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na innbyn kha do-oihku tua,”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci hae. Tukeiccuze Israel hae balyn tuh mih bu raveih lang a ki hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:1">2Sa 20.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama Rehoboam nynh Judah khua hae kya umpaw Israel hae kha a uk hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangsete ryalawsahnaw kyaze uktu bawi athuapaw Adoram kha Rehoboam Siapharan nynh saw zah, Israel hae nynh lung te phe chih lan a deih hae. Rehoboam Siapharan tuh Jerusalem lang ccue khylan a marangle kya arangte a ccikuh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhcite Israel hae nynh David ciihan kha atunin cia a dou hae.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah te Benjamin Ram e Akoihkuhpaw Khua hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 12:21-24">1Si 12.21-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam nynh Jerusalem khua he a thua te, Israel hae kha tuk lan zah peenaw kha Rehoboam kuih kalan pyathui khylan, Judah phin te Benjamin phin kya-e popaw rhawkaw cciing kheit thong sung tarya kha a pum hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Pachia ccungccapaw Shemaiah kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon ccapaw, Judah siapharan Rehoboam te Judah ram te Benjamin ram umpaw Israel balyn kyakhe, <verse number="4" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae uno hae kha tuk lan ccianua nan oh. Nae balynte nae inn lang ki oh, pawccecize e hynh kamaw kyate yn thuapaw nynh thua, a ci cite hopah hae,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngae hae zah Jeroboam kha tuk leite a kitaw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rehoboam tuh Jerusalem kya um zah, thungkhawkunaw hanlan Judah ram kya khua hae kha a rae hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem, Etam, Tekoa, <verse number="7" style="v" />Beth-zur, Soko, Adullam, <verse number="8" style="v" />Gath, Mareshah, Zif, <verse number="9" style="v" />Adoraim, Lakhish, Azekah, <verse number="10" style="v" />Zorah, Aijalon te Hebron khua kha a rae hae, e hae tuh Judah ram te Benjamin ram e lungrua te akoihkuhpaw khua hae nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Rhawlungrua hae kha phe tyn lan rae zah rhawbawi hae kha a nung hae, te looh, chitui te misutui kha a ccakhung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Khua takyh kya khawriaphua hae te ccoi hae kha nung zah khua hae kha myarya tyn lan a rae. Tuhcite Judah ram te Benjamin ram kha a uk.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam A Bawm hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel ram balyn kya um hae paw ranpibawi hae te Levi hae nynh mih umnaw miakaw kyate amaw kalan a pan hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi phin hae nynh a hoi hae paw ram hae te mih hoirumnaw kha cciataw hae zah Judah ram te Jerusalem khua lang a cceih hae, pawccecize Jeroboam te a ccapaw hae nynh minmin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi hae ryalaw lanpaw kha khee hae zah, <verse number="15" style="v" />ahangpaw hmin hae, miaa-khozi hanlan te amaw nynh a raekupaw vaetuataw hae hanlan amaw a ranpibawi hae kha a khang hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:31">1Si 12.31</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha ccung khylan mih thinlung te a ry ccaccing hae paw nynh tuh Israel phin hae balyn kyate pou hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, mih minpaaw hae Pachia kalan silawnaw rae khylan Levi phin hae kha a zui hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin nynh Judah peenaw kha tynsah hae zah Solomon ccapaw Rehoboam kha kum thum lungkhu a khynsah hae, pawccecize minmin nynh kum thum lungkhu David te Solomon laanpi kha a zui hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam Innbyn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rehoboam nynh Mahalath kha zu lang a hoi, Mahalath a paaw tuh David ccapaw Jerimoth thua zah a nung tuh Jesse ccapaw Eliab a ccanung Abihail nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning nynh a saahpyapaw ccapaw hae tuh: Jeush, Shemariah te Zaham. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukoute Absalom ccanung Maakah kha zu lang hoi zah Abijah, Attai, Ziza te Shelomith kha a saah hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehoboam nynh Absalom ccanung Maakah kha ccangpaw a zu hae te a lovaenung hae balyn laeze a sungsahua (zupi lu haw lae tarya te lovae sung taruh hoi zah, ccapaw lu kuin lae tarya te ccanung sung taruh a saah hae). <verse number="22" style="v" />Rehoboam nynh Maakah ccapaw Abijah kha siapharan lang a paccyn keiccuze a uno hae kyaze bawi lepaw lan a nung. <verse number="23" style="v" />Hawrarih lante ryalah zah, Judah ram te Benjamin ram kya a umpaw akoihkuhpaw khua hae miakaw kyakhe a ccapaw hae abang kha pong pazaekuh lan a nung hae; aepaw niapaw looh patae pya hae zah, zu patae a dypya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Izip nynh Judah A Tuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 14:25-28">1Si 14.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam uknaw tuh tyn zah thawzung he a hoithung tuh, aning te a kya umpaw Israel hae balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya kha a vua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw mih lungzi khyh keiccuze Rehoboam nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum pangawnaw kum khe Izip Siapharan Shishak nynh Jerusalem kha <verse number="3" style="v" />marangle thong kheit za ning, marang rhawkaw thong sung taruh te tuk lan a ccianua thung. Izip ram te amaw ryte a cceihkheih hae paw tuh riatae um khyh hae—Libia hae, Sukkiim hae te Ethiopia hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah ram e akoihkuhpaw khua hae kha lah zah Jerusalem cia a thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Shishak keiccuze Jerusalem kya a sueluakuh hae paw Rehoboam te Judah bawi hae kalan khe profeh Shemaiah tuh yn thua zah minmin kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Kae hynh nae vua oh keiccuze nanning kha Shishak kuih kalan kae vua vae oh, a ci,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh Israel bawi hae te siapharan nynh zakawsangsakuh hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a ding,” a ci hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin tuh zakaw a sangsakuh hae cipaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh he a muih tuh, Shemaiah kalan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya yn thua zah, “Minmin tuh zakaw a sangsakuh vae hae; minmin kha ka roh lan khyh hae, luenaw abang ka pya cih hae zah Shishak kuih kha mangte Jerusalem tungvaw kya ka thinrianaw kha bu thua lan khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhzemah minmin nynh kae ka ryalaw te ccangpaw laephi uktu hae ryalaw alaenaw kha a nythya nawlan hae, minmin tuh Shishak a ryalahtu lang a tang cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhcite Izip Siapharan Shishak nynh Jerusalem kha ccianua thung zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e sisua hae te siapharan inn e sisua hae kha a law; pawpaw balyn kha pong a law. Solomon nynh a raepaw sui khawriaphua hae kha mah a law;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:16-17">1Si 10.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:15-16">2Sh 9.15-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />thuasalama Rehoboam Siapharan nynh tuh-e hae hanpaw sohin khawriaphua hae kha raeru zah siapharan inn thuakaw a ngawpaw rhawviatu bawi hae kuih kya a nung. <verse number="11" style="v" />Siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang a tee takyh vae ze, rhawviatu hae tuh tuh-e khawriaphua hae kha ccyngte leih oun cceih hae zah, rhawviatu hae khaan langkhe bua leih a kikhae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Rehoboam nynh zakaw a sangsaku keiccuze minmin kha marya ro athua khyh nawlan hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh a kyate a maeleihkuh; tuhpiaze Judah ram kya uccaw a umtuzia ahoy.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rehoboam Siapharan nynh Jerusalem kya a thawzung tynsakuh zah a uk. Rehoboam tuh sung pali kum kheit acih te ram kha a uk takaw; Jerusalem kya kum haw lae sari a uk, tuh-e khua tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a min nung nawlan Israel phin hae balyn kyate a popaw khua nynh thua. A nung min tuh Naamah cikuh zah Ammon ccungccaw nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thinlung ccaccing te a ry khyh keiccuze aning nynh hoyleinaw kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Rehoboam nynh rya a lawpaw atakaw te athangnaw cia, profeh Shemaiah ccauh te profeh Iddo ccauh kya thokeinaw ccazing thyhte a zei hae. Rehoboam te Jeroboam laku kya rhawtukkunaw po a um. <verse number="16" style="v" />Rehoboam tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah David khua kya a uu hae; te amaw ccelang a ccapaw Abijah nynh siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Abijah nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:1-8">1Si 15.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboam Siapharan nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae taryanaw kum khe Abijah nynh Judah ram kha uk takaw zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem kya kum thum a uk. A nung min tuh Mikaiah cikuh zah Gibeah khuapaw Uriel ccanung nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">Abijah te Jeroboam laku kya rhawtukkunaw a um. <verse number="3" style="v" />Abijah nynh a popaw rhawkaw arawthungpaw cciing pali te rhaw a tuk; Jeroboam nynh a popaw rhawkaw athungpaw cciing tarya te rhaw a tukru. <verse number="4" style="v" />Abijah tuh Efraim muaram a umpaw Zemaraim Mua hary apannaw khe thadyn zah, “Jeroboam te Israel hae balyn, ka bya yn ngaepya tua oh! <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh Israel ram kya siapharan lang tangnaw hynh David te a ccapaw hae kalan loi byakinnaw te zungzae a pya vae hae cipaw kha na nyh khyh oh tou? <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhzemah David ccapaw Solomon a ryalahtupaw Nebat a ccapaw Jeroboam nynh thokuh zah a bawipaw kha a dou; <verse number="7" style="v" />Rehoboam tuh dih ung zah pawte ryalaw lan cipaw nythya leite minmin tungvaw cyiru khonaw a hoi khyh lyakhe ccungkia leipaw te ccungccaleipaw hae tuh Jeroboam kalan sueluakuh hae zah Solomon ccapaw Rehoboam kha a rawse hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Atu nanning tuh ccungccaw na lung oh zah Jerobaom nynh nae hanlan pachia lang ae raepya oh paw sui vaetuataw hae kha na hoi oh keiccuze nanning nynh David ccapaw hae kuih kya umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> peenaw kha kae dou kho cih cite na tuaku oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi hae, Aaron ccapaw hae te Levi phin hae kha na dee oh zah ramccang hae hawte naemaw nynh ranpibawi hae kha na khangkuh khyh oh tou? Tangnua anopaw te thuasah, tuutepaw sa sari te thuasah thyaasaku lan yn cceihpaw miakaw tuh pachia athua lei hae paw kya-e ranpibawi lang a tang hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama kaening hanlan tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hynh kae Pachia thua zah amaw kha kae vua khyh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya a lahtu lang Aaron ciihan hae kha kae hoi zah, mih rya a lahtu lang Levi phin hae kha kae hoi. <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan awkhua takyhte zete takyh kya maee-ute silawnaw rae hae zah mynkhuhpaw kha a u hae, sui thyaapaw ccaboi vawlan khe nungpyapaw sanlou kha thuasah, zete takyh maeekhua a aw ccaw cite sui maeekhuatung kha thuasah a paccyn hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae Pachia nynh oun nawpaw kha kae cyi, thuasalama nanning nynh amaw kha na vua vae oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Dotua oh, Pachia tuh kae kya um zah oun cciakhaetu nynh thua, Pachia ranpibawi hae tuh nanning tuknawpaw roi ccaesah khylan rhawtuknawpaw mungkae a hoi hae. Pou Israel hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nae minpaaw hae Pachia kha dou nan oh; pawccecize na tae lan khyh oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah hae kha mih nulang te a pounua lan hae paw buhkhawtu hae kha Jeroboam nynh a saw hae; amaw rhawkaw hae tuh Judah hae malang khe um hae zah buhkhawtu hae tuh mih nulang khe a um hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah hae nynh maeleihkute he a do hae tuh, nulang malang te rhaw hae a um hae. Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sia hae zah ranpibawi hae nynh mungkae a tu hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Judah ccungccaw hae tuh rhawdounaw roi a saw hae. Judah hae nynh he a sia hae tuh, Pachia nynh Jeroboam te Israel balyn kha Abijah te Judah hae malang khe rhaw a shungsah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel hae tuh Judah hae malang te ccue hae zah, Pachia nynh Judah hae kuih kya a pya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah te a rhawkaw hae nynh minmin kha tae hae zah patae a chia hae; popaw Israel ccungccaw cciing pangaw a chih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhcite Israel hae tuh tuin ccyh kya rhaw a shung hae, Judah hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, mih minpaaw hae Pachia kha a doliaku hae keiccuze rhaw a tae hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Abijah nynh Jeroboam kha deehui zah a khua hae kha a lua: Bethel khua te a khua taraw hae, Jeshanah khua te a khua taraw hae, Efron khua te a khua taraw hae kha a lua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Abijah she lya tuh Jeroboam nynh a thungnaw kha muethui vae khyh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh detah zah a chih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Abijah tuh thawzung houhouh a hoi. Zu lu haw lae pali hoi zah ccapaw lu kuin lae ning te ccanung lu haw lae taruh a saah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Abijah nynh rya a lawpaw, a ozia te a cyisahnaw tuh profeh Iddo kya-e phungpaw ccauh kya a zei hae.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Asa A Uknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abijah tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah David khua kya a uu hae. A ccapaw Asa nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. Aning she kya ram tuh kum haw lungkhu adae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia muihnaw kya ahoypaw te ahmepaw kha a rae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ramccang hae kya-e silawhang hae te ahangpaw hmin hae kha ccaring lah zah, zohtuh hae kha a ro hae, Asherah hae kha nge zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah hae kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, mih minpaaw hae Pachia kha ccung lan te phungbya te kawbya kha zui lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah ram e khua hae balyn kyate ahangpaw hmin hae te mynkhuhpaw unawpaw silawhang hae kha mah a vua. Aning kuihkaw kya peenaw lungkhu daenaw a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram kya daenaw a um lyakhe Judah ram kya akoihkuhpaw khua hae kha a rae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha daenaw a pya keiccuze tuh-e ccyh lya rhawtukkunaw um khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh Judah hae kha, “E khua hae hynh rae oh sih lah, khualungrua, innhangpaw, koikua te accaw hae khate koih oh sih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kha ah ccung oh keiccuze ram tuh ahmaw kya-e nynh athua ung, aening nynh amaw kha ah ccung oh zah aning nynh aening kha teitei langte balyn daenaw oun pya,” a cipya hae. Tuhcite khua hae kha rae hae zah a kaethung hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Asa nynh Judah phin kya-e khawriaphua lepaw te ccoi a kyngpaw rhawkaw cciing thum hoi zah, Benjamin phin kya-e khawriaphua te li a kyngpaw rhawkaw cciing ning thong sung tarya a hoi; e hae balyn tuh athungpaw rhawkaw hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ethiopia kha Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia ccungccaw Zerah nynh rhawkaw cciing haw, marangle za thum ryte minmin kha ccianua hae zah Mareshah kyacia a thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Asa nynh amaw kha tungku khylan pounua zah Mareshah kya Zefathah accya khe tukku lan a nounuaku hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, a Pachia kha ko zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, athungpaw te anyaapaw laku kya bawmnaw pya lanpaw kha nang na hanlan alaenaw um khyh. Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia, beih oun bawmtua, pawccecize nang kha kae doliakuh zah na min te hynh-e ccungccaw patae hynh tuk lan kae ccianua hae. Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh kae Pachia nynh na thua; ccungccaw nynh nang kha ae tae nan sah,” a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Ethiopia hae kha Asa te Judah hae malang khe tae hae zah Ethiopia hae tuh a ccue hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Asa te a kya umpaw rhawkaw hae nynh Gerar kyacia a dee hae, Ethiopia hae tuh a hiinhypaw lu kheit san a um lei lan ciate a chih hae; pawccecize minmin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te a rhawkaw hae malang khe ro athua hae. Judah hae nynh luadepaw uccaw patae kha a phuku hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Gerar pepan umpaw khua hae balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a ri hae keiccuze Judah hae nynh tuh-e khua hae kha a tae hae. Khua hae balyn kyakhe luadepaw uccaw patae a um keiccuze thiing hae zah a lawku hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Sahiin a hoi hae paw bu kha mah tuk hae zah tuu te miaa patae te kalauh hae kha a lawku hae. Tukoute Jerusalem lang a ki hae.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia muisaw tuh Oded ccapaw Azariah tungvaw yn thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh Asa te tungku khylan cceih zah, “Pou Asa te Judah phin hae balyn te Benjamin phin hae balyn, ka bya hynh ngaetua oh: Nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryte na um lungkhu oh tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nanning ryte a um. Amaw kha na ccung oh ze, na muih cih oh, thuasalama amaw kha na vua oh zetuh, nanning kha ae vua cih oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccyh hynhsepi cia Israel tuh Pachia ccaccing hoi khyh, ccangpahtu ranpibawi kha hoi khyh, phungbya mah hoi leite a um; <verse number="4" style="v" />thuasalama riathaenaw he a tung hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kalan maeleihkuh hae zah he a ccung hae tuh, amaw kha a muih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lya tuh a poutupaw hanlan thuasah, a teetupaw hanlan thuasah khynnaw um khyh, pawccecize ram takyh kya um hae paw balyn tungvaw khe thinphangnaw te ccawku leinaw a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin tuh palae tui lan a koi hae, ram kheit te ram kheit, khua kheit te khua kheit a doukuh hae, pawccecize Pachia nynh riathaenaw phuinccing te vawsaw a pya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh nae rawthungsakuh oh! Nae kuih kha a thawzyasah nan oh, pawccecize nae ryalaw mee na mue cih oh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Oded ccapaw Azariah nynh profehbya a hopaw e bya hae hynh Asa nynh he a thae tuh, a rawthungsakuh zah Judah ram, Benjamin ram te Efraim muaram kya-e a lawpaw khua hae balyn kyate anungsikuhpaw zohtuh hae kha a vua hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn tee takawnaw khaan malang umpaw silawhang kha a raethui. <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah phin hae te Benjamin phin hae balyn kha thuasah, Efraim, Manasseh te Simeon ram hae kyate oun thua hae zah ramccang hae hawte a umbua hae paw kha thuasah a pum hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia tuh amaw kya a um cipaw he a muih hae te, Israel ram kyate ccungccaw patae tuh amaw kalan a nuekuh hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Asa nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae pangawnaw, sawpaw sah thumnaw khe minmin kha Jerusalem kya a pum hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nin khe luadete a thuakhae hae paw tangnuapaw za sari te tuu thong sari khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan silawnaw a rae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, mih minpaaw hae Pachia kha mih thinlung balyn te, mih tuanaw balyn te ccung khylan byakinnaw lungkhu lang a tee hae. <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha a ccung leipaw miakaw nopi, pise, imua, piccan humhung athua zemah chia athua cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Myarya ccaepaw roi te, siaruate, mungkae te saki tu biate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan thyalawkute byakinkunaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah hae balyn tuh tuh-e byakinkunaw a rae hae keiccuze mih lungpaw; pawccecize mih thinlung balyn te byakinkunaw rae hae zah mih rynaw balyn te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a ccung hae keiccuze a muih hae, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha teitei langte balyn daenaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asa Siapharan a minnung Maakah nynh Asherah hanlan anungsikuhpaw zohtuh kha a raepya keiccuze Asa nynh siapharan a nung thuanaw kyate a phua. Asa nynh a zohtuh kha ngepah zah palae tui lan a roh koute Kidron Vaw pe khe maee te a soi. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama ahangpaw hmin hae kha Israel ram kyate vua khyh. Tuhzemah Asa thinlung tuh a she lungkhu balyn hmerarih lan a um. <verse number="18" style="v" />A paaw nynh byakinkute a hlupaw lasung hae te amaw nynh byakinkute a hlupaw sui, ngun te angphe hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu langkhe a nung. <verse number="19" style="v" />Asa nynh a uknaw sung thum kum pangawnaw kum cia rhawtukkunaw um khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Asa te Benhadad Pankheihnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:17-22">1Si 15.17-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asa nynh ram a uknaw sung thum kum taruhnaw kum khe Israel siapharan Baasha nynh Judah ram kha tuk lan ccianua zah, Judah siapharan Asa kalan humhung mah a pou lei nawlan te a tee lei nawlan Ramah khua kha a rae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Asa nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn te siapharan inn kya-e sisuakhaan kya umpaw sui te ngun kha lah zah, Damaskas khua umpaw Siria siapharan Benhadad kalan ky zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka paaw te na paaw nynh a la pankheih hae hawte, kae te nang mah pankheih sih; sui te ngun hynh kae ky; Israel siapharan Baasha nynh kae hynh yn kitaw nawlan, aning te na pankheihnaw oh kha roh ccavae,” cite bya a taw. <verse number="4" style="v" />Benhadad nynh Siapharan Asa bya kha ngae zah, Israel khua hae kha tuk khylan a rhawbawi hae sawnua hae zah, Ijon, Dan, Abel-maim te Naftali ram e sisua nungnaw khua balyn kha a tae hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Baasha nynh he a thae te, Ramah khua a raepaw rya kha a haeungtaw. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Siapharan Asa nynh Judah hae balyn kha cciakhae hae zah, Baasha nynh Ramah khua a raenawpaw lung hae te thing hae kha a law hae, tuh-e tuhte Siapharan Asa nynh Geba khua te Mizpah khua kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe profeh Hanani tuh Judah Siapharan Asa kalan yn thua zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha doliaku leite Siria siapharan kha na doliaku keiccuze Siria siapharan a rhawkaw hae tuh na kuih kyate a lue vae hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethiopia ccungccaw hae te Libia ccungccaw hae tuh marangle te marang rhawkaw patae ryte myaryamaw alungpaw rhawkaw hae thua khyh hae tou? Tuhzemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na doliaku keiccuze aning nynh minmin kha na kuih kya ae pya. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kya mih thinlung hmerarih lan a um hae paw kha thawzung pya khylan laephi pynpi hynh marya a do. E na cyipaw hynh ngaeenaw ccaccing nynh thua; atu kyate rhaw na tuk vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh Asa tuh profeh tungvaw a thinria keiccuze khii zah thong lungkhu a nung, pawccecize e kong keiccuze tuh-e paw tungvaw a bungpaw. Tuh ccyh lyakhe Asa nynh ccungccaw abang kha a tuaa a sah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Asa Ccinaw te Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:23-24">1Si 15.23-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asa a cyisahnaw kha atakaw te athangnaw cia Judah te Israel Siapharan hae Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Asa tuh ram a uknaw sung thum kum takuanaw kum khe a ccu kya ccinaw hoi zah a ccinaw tuh myarya le; tuhcih mang a ccih pite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ccung leite, sibawi hae kha bawmnaw a ngiaku hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Asa tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, ram a uknaw sung pali kum kheitnaw kum khe a chih. <verse number="14" style="v" />David khua kya amaw nynh a raekupaw shawku kya a uu hae. Mynkhuhpaw a raethya hae paw nynh a rae hae paw mynkhuhpaw aphuinphuin te phe abeihpaw taang kyakhe a isah hae; sawtuanaw pyanawpaw maee pipi kha a tua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jehoshafat Uknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asa ccapaw Jehoshafat nynh a paaw ccelang siapharan lang tang zah Israel kha rawsete a thawzung a umsaku. <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah ram kya-e akoihkuhpaw khua hae balyn kyakhe rhawkaw a nung, Judah ram te Efraim ram kya a paaw Asa nynh a lawpaw khua hae kyakhe rhawviatu rhawkaw hae kha a nung. <verse number="3" style="v" />A paaw nynh masaty a la zuipaw laanpi kha a zui keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Jehoshafat kya a um; aning nynh Baal pachia hae kha ccung khyh, <verse number="4" style="v" />a paaw Pachia kha ccung zah, Israel hae nynh a zui hae paw laanpi kha zui leite, a kawbya kha a zui. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh peenaw kha a kuih kya a tynsah. Judah hae balyn nynh Jehoshafat kha lasung pya hae zah myarya hoirum zah sawtuanaw a ccou. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi kyakhe a thinlung tuh rawthungnaw a hoi; tuhpiaze ahangpaw hmin hae te Asherah hae kha Judah ram kyate a ro hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram a uknaw kum thumnaw kum khe a kuihkaw e bawi hae, Benhail, Obadiah, Zekhariah, Nethanel te Mikaiah kha Judah ram e khua hae kya ccangpahtu lang a saw hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin ryte Levi phin Shemaiah, Nethaniah, Zebadiah, Asahel, Shemiramoth, Jehonathan, Adonijah, Tobijah te Tobadonijah kha a sawbua hae; e Levi phin hae ryte ranpibawi hae Elishama te Jehoram kha a sawbua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phungbya ccauh kha ccyngkute Judah ram kya a ccangpya hae; Judah ram e khua hae balyn kalan pong lekuh lan cceih hae zah ccungccaw hae kha a ccangpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah ram pepan umpaw ram hae balyn tungvaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrinaw nynh thuanua hae zah Jehoshafat kha rhawtuk ngan khyh hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistin hae abang nynh Jehoshafat kha lasung ccyngpah hae zah, ngunto lang ngun kha a pya hae; Arab hae nynh mah tuutepaw thong sari za sari te miaatepaw thong sari za sari kha a pya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehoshafat tuh byabyate thawzung a hoithung. Judah ram kya rhawlungrua hae te uccaw ccakhungnaw khua hae kha a rae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah ram e khua hae kya rya pipi kha a law. Jerusalem kya rhawkaw hae te athungpaw rhawkaw hae kha a hoi. <verse number="14" style="v" />E hynh puizia raveih thyhte ataruinte riapaw nynh thua: Judah phin kya-e rhawkaw athong ukpaw rhawbawi hae tuh: rhawbawipaw Adnah te athungpaw rhawkaw hae cciing thum a um hae, <verse number="15" style="v" />Adnah he a zuipaw rhawbawipaw tuh Jehohanan thua zah, aning kya rhawkaw cciing ning thong sung tarya a um hae, <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehohanan he a zuipaw rhawbawi tuh Zikhri ccapaw Amasiah nynh thua, aning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya elang amaw lungthote a pyakuhpaw nynh thua, aning kya athungpaw rhawkaw cciing ning a um hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin phin kyate: athungpaw rhawkaw Eliada thua zah, aning kya li te khawriaphua a ccyngkuhpaw rhawkaw cciing ning a um hae, <verse number="18" style="v" />Eliada he a zuipaw tuh Jehozabad thua zah, aning kya rhawtuk lan paccynkute a um hae paw cciing kheit thong sung tarya a um hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />E hae hynh siapharan kya rya a lah hae, e hae holeite Judah ram pynpi e akoihkuhpaw khua hae kya siapharan nynh a nung hae paw a um ung hae.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Mikaiah nynh Shungnaw Kong A Hodae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:1-28">1Si 22.1-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoshafat tuh myarya hoirum zah sawtuanaw a ccou; Ahab te zuvaw lang tangnaw khate puizia kyngkunaw a rae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kum beihtaraw alia koute Ahab kalan Samaria khua lang a cceih. Amaw te a kya cceihbua hae paw hanlan Ahab nynh tuu te tangnuapaw patae chiapah hae zah, Ramoth-gilead kha ccianuate tuk lan a hyy. <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel siapharan Ahab nynh Judah siapharan Jehoshafat kha, “Ramoth-gilead lang nae cciakhae cih tou?” a cipya. Jehoshafat nynh, “Nang te kae tuh pynkheihpaw nynh ah thua; ka ccungccaw hae tuh na ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae. Rhawtuknaw kya kae pankhae cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoshafat nynh Israel siapharan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha khiatua ty hin,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh profeh hae za pali kha pum hae zah, “Ramoth-gilead kha tuk lan kae ccianua cih tou, kae ccianua lan khyh tou?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “Ccianua; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh siapharan nang na kuih kalan ae pya cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Jehoshafat nynh, “Aening nynh khia lanpaw ccangpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh um vae khyh tou?” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh Jehoshafat kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha byakhia nawlan ccangpaw lu kheit, Imlah ccapaw Mikaiah a um ung; tuhzemah aning kha ka hua, pawccecize kae ka konglang bya hoypaw ho boi khyh, ronaw kong cci nynh a ho,” a cipya. Jehoshafat nynh, “Tuhcite siapharan nynh byaho nan,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Israel siapharan nynh bawi lu kheit kha ko zah, “Imlah ccapaw Mikaiah kha arangte yn thuakhae,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Israel siapharan te Judah siapharan Jehoshafat tuh mih angkiccua kikute, Samaria khua koikua teenaw malang huihmin kya umpaw bawitungkhung kya a haung hae; mih malang khe profeh balyn nynh profehbya a ho hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Khenaanah ccapaw Zedekiah nynh sivaw ki hae kha raekuh zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Siria hae kha ro athua mawlaezung hae, e sivaw ki hae hynhte na thuing cih oh, a ci,” cite a ho. <verse number="11" style="v" />Profeh balyn nynh mah tuhcite hobua hae zah, “Ramoth-gilead kha ccianua thung lah, taetua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh siapharan nang na kuih kya ae pya cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mikaiah ko lan a cceihpaw locceihtupaw nynh Mikaiah kha, “Dotua, profeh hae nynh siapharan kyakhe bya hoypaw kha phe lokuh lante a hopya hae; nang nynh mah minmin hawte bya hoypaw kha hopah bua,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Mikaiah nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, ka Pachia nynh a hopaw bya kha ka ho cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mikaiah tuh siapharan kya he a thua te, siapharan nynh, “Mikaiah, Ramoth-gilead kha tuk khylan kae ccianua cih tou, kae ccianua lan khyh tou?” a cipya. Mikaiah nynh, “Ccianua thung lah, taetua; minmin kha na kuih kya pya athua cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan nynh, “Akyhpaw bya laelan ccangpaw bya kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te nae hopya khyh nawlan, vae hohzeihmou bya kae kinsakuh cih?” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Mikaiah nynh, “Israel hae balyn tuh tuurin a hoi leipaw tuu hae hawte mua vawlan phiariphiarae a um hae paw kha ka muih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘E hae tuh bawi hoi khyh hae; mimaw inn raveih lang daebabi lan ki hae sah,’ a ci,” cite a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Nam 27.17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Eze 34.5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9.36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6.34</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh Jehoshafat kha, “Aning tuh kae ka konglang hynh bya hoypaw ho boi khyh, ronaw kong cci nynh a ho, cite kae hopah khyh tou?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Mikaiah nynh, “Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a bawitungkhung kya haung zah, vaaw rhawkaw hae balyn tuh a voi a rang te a pe khe a thadyn hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘Israel siapharan Ahab tuh cceihthung zah Ramoth-gilead kya a chi nawlan, hum nynh mou a tuhou cih?’ a ci. Lu kheit nynh ccangte, ccangpaw lu kheit nynh ccangte a ho hae, <verse number="20" style="v" />muisaw lu kheit yn thua zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang thadyn zah, ‘Kamaw ka tuhou cih,’ a ci. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘Pawtemou na tuhou cih?’ cite a khia. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning nynh, ‘Ka cceih cih zah a profeh hae balyn munglae kyakhe ahynthyapaw muisaw lang ka tang cih,’ a ci. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘Aning kha na la tuhou cih, phe na tuhou kho cih; la cceih lah tuhcite la cyih,’ a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ahynthyapaw muisaw kha e na profeh hae munglae kya a nung vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang na hanlan ronaw bya a ho vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tetuh Khenaanah ccapaw Zedekiah nynh Mikaiah kha ccianua zah a byaki kha bia zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh nang kha bya hopya khylan ka kyate paw laanpi te mou a pou?” a cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Mikaiah nynh, “Nang nynh alungkhu lang e akhaan lungkhu lang reku khylan he na tee nin khe na muih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh, “Mikaiah kha kyng oh lah, khua uktu Amon te siapharan ccapaw Joash kalan cciakhae oh; <verse number="26" style="v" />te ‘Siapharan nynh hynhte a ho: E ccungccaw hynh thonginn kya nung oh, daenaw te kae thua mawlaezung tui te looh beihtaraw kyalya la pya oh, a ci,’ cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Mikaiah nynh, “Daenaw te bua nae ki zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka kyate bya a ho khyhpaw nynh athua cih. Pou ccungccaw hae, nae balynte thaetua oh!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahab Shungnaw te Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:29-35">1Si 22.29-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel siapharan te Judah siapharan Jehoshafat tuh Ramoth-gilead khua lang rhawtuk lan a cceih hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh Jehoshafat kha, “Ka muinsan rulaekute rhawtuknaw lang ka cceihbua cih, thuasalama nang tuh na angkiccua kha kikuh,” a cipya. Tuhcite Israel siapharan tuh a muinsan rulaekuh zah rhawtuknaw lang a cceih. <verse number="30" style="v" />Siria siapharan nynh a marangle rhawbawi hae sung thum lu ning kha, “Ccangpaw ccungccaw adihpaw thuasah, alepaw thuasah tuk leite, Israel siapharan kyalya kha tuk oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Marangle rhawbawi hae nynh Jehoshafat kha he a muih hae te, “Aning hynh Israel siapharan nynh thua,” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze aning kha tuk khylan a maenuaku hae; te Jehoshafat nynh sia zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a bawm. Pachia nynh minmin kha amaw kyate ccanglang a cciasah hae, <verse number="32" style="v" />pawccecize Israel siapharan thua khyh cipaw kha marangle rhawbawi hae nynh he a nyh hae te, amaw kha deehui vae leite a kitaw hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Lukheitpaw nynh ee tutae leite a li te kaw huataw zah Israel siapharan kha a rhawtuk-uccaw te a bykhaw laku khe a tungsah; tukeiccuze a marangle a mawngtupaw kha, “Vaemaw phe ka mue, tukeiccuze maeleihkuh lah, rhawtuknaw kyate yn poukhae,” a cipya. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuin nin tuh thawte rhaw a tukkuh hae, Israel siapharan tuh a marangle lungkhu khe ngeikuh zah Siria hae kalan khe zete cia a hawi; te khuanin ccaw ccyh khe a chih.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah siapharan Jehoshafat tuh Jerusalem umpaw a inn lang khyndadyh lan a ki. <verse number="2" style="v" />Hanani ccapaw profeh Jehu tuh Siapharan Jehoshafat te tungku khylan cceih zah amaw kha, “Nang nynh ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha bawm te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a huatu hae kha na sungsah cih hae tou? E keiccuze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh na tungvaw accah vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuhzemah Asherah hae kha ram lungkhu te na vua hae zah na thinlung te Pachia ccung lan na zuaku keiccuze na tungvaw kya hoynaw abang kha muih athua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoshafat nynh Raethuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoshafat tuh Jerusalem kya khua a sah; te Beersheba kyate Efraim muaram kyacia ccungccaw hae kalan cceih zah mih minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan bua a kikhae hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah ram e akoihkuhpaw khua hae miakaw kya, khua takyh kyakhe byapiatu hae kha nung hae zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />byapiatu hae kyakhe, “Na cyi oh paw kha hoyte tuabia oh, pawccecize bya na pia oh paw kha ccungccaw ccelang thua leite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccelang bya na pia oh paw nynh thua; bya na pianaw oh kyakhe aning tuh nae kya a um. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> raw kha rih oh; na cyi oh paw kha raeringkuh oh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, aening Pachia kya tuh ahme lei lante byapianaw, mirymihuaponaw, pyaruh lawkunaw um khyh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Jerusalem kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang byapia khylan te byalungnaw kha byapia khylan, Jehoshafat nynh Levi phin hae, ranpibawi hae te Israel phin hae kya-e lu hae kha a khang hae. Minmin tuh Jerusalem kya a um hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh kawpya hae zah, “Hynhte rya na lah cih oh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawri te, lungzinaw te, nae thinlung balyn te rya na lah cih oh; <verse number="10" style="v" />Mimaw khua kya um hae paw nae uno hae nynh chiise luanaw kong thuasah, phungbya, kawbya, phunglang, phungzae hae kong thuasah nae kalan byathan oun thuakhae hae ze, minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang cyiseipaw seinaw a hoi khyh nawlan hae te naemaw te nae uno hae tungvaw kya thinrianaw a um khyh nawlan minmin kha na ccangpah cih oh. Tuhte na cyi oh ze cyiseipaw seinaw kha na hoi lan khyh oh. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalaw miakaw kya ranpibawi Amariah tuh nanning uktu lang a um; Judah siapharan ryalaw miakaw kya Judah phin uktu bawi Zebadiah, Ishmael ccapaw tuh nanning uktu lang a um; Levi phin hae nynh bawi hae lante rya ae lawpah cih oh. Rawthungte ryalah oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ccungccaw hoy hae paw kya um vae sah!” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Moab hae te Ammon hae Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E koute Moab hae te Ammon hae nynh Meunim hae abang ryte Jehoshafat kha tuk lan a ccianua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Locceihtu hae nynh oun thua hae zah Jehoshafat kha, “Edom ram kyate, rili khuraw langte ccungccaw zapi patae tuh nang kha tuk khylan oun cceih hae zah Hazazontamar kya nynh a um hae,” cite a hopya hae (tuh-e tuh En-gedi nynh thua). <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoshafat tuh rih zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ccung khylan paccynkuh zah Judah ram pynpi kya looh-ae sung lan a thaesah hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah hae balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bawmnaw kha mue khylan a pumkuh hae; Judah ram e khua hae balyn kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ccung khylan a thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoshafat Sawsangnaw te Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoshafat tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn, voidu thawpaw malang, Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae a pumkuh hae paw kyakhe thadyn zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae minpaaw hae Pachia, nang tuh vaawlang umpaw Pachia na thua khyh tou? Minphuin hae kya-e ram hae balyn tuh nang nynh na uk khyh tou? Humhung nynh mah ae khee ngan khyh nawlan, na kuih kya huhan te thungnaw a um. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pou kae Pachia, nang nynh e ram kya um hae paw kha na ccungccaw Israel hae malang te na dee hae zah na banpaw Abraham ciihan hae kha zungzae na pya khyh hae tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa 41.8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Jam 2.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin tuh e ram kya um hae zah na min hanlan beikinnthyaa kha sak hae zah, <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Hoyleinaw, thaloi, byapianaw, shethya te ccakannaw nynh kae tungvaw oun thuanua ze, e inn malang te namaw malang kae thadyn cih, pawccecize na min tuh e inn kya um zah kaening nynh kae riathaenaw kyate namaw kalan kae sia cih, te nang nynh nae thaepah cih zah nae bawm cih,’ a ci hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Atu dotua, Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate a ccia lya hae ze, tuknaw kaw na pya khyh hae zah Israel hae nynh sibiate a ro lei hae paw Ammon hae, Moab hae te Seir Mua e ccungccaw hae nynh<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:4-19">Deu 2.4-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />rho lang nae pyapaw ram kyate kaening hynh dee lan oun ccianua hae zah liaru lan oun paccynnuaku hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou kae Pachia, minmin tungvaw bya na pia lan khyh hae tou? Pawccecize kaening dou khylan oun ccianuatu hae hynh-e ccungccaw zapi patae rawse nawlan thawzung kae hoi khyh. Pawte cyi lan kae nyh khyh, namaw rou nynh kae do vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh lyatuin Judah hae balyn tuh imua hae, mih zu mih ccaaw hae ryte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a thadyn hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh a pumkuh hae paw laku kya umpaw Jahaziel tungvaw kya a thua; aning tuh Zekhariah ccapaw, Zekhariah tuh Benaiah ccapaw, Benaiah tuh Jeiel ccapaw, Jeiel tuh Mattaniah ccapaw, Mattaniah tuh Levi phin, Asaf ccapaw hae ciihan nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Jahaziel nynh, “Judah hae balyn, Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae te Siapharan Jehoshafat, ngaetua oh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte ae hopya oh: ‘E ccungccaw zapi patae hae hynh rih nan oh, nae bungzou nan sah; pawccecize rhawtuknaw tuh nanning kya-e thua khyh, Pachia kya-e nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.15-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:1-4">Deu 20.1-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Awkhualan minmin kha tuk khylan ccianua bung oh; minmin tuh Ziz kaethungnaw laanpi kyate oun cceihthung cih hae; Jeruel ramkaw athonaw, accya athangnaw khe na la muih cih oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pou Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae, e rhawtuknaw tuh nanning nynh tuk lanpaw thua khyh; nae umnaw kya phang thadyn oh lah, naemaw ccelang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae taepya oh paw kha do oh,’ a ci. Rih nan oh lah, nae bungzou nan sah; awkhualan minmin kha ccianua oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nae kya a um cih,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:13-14">Exo 14.13-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Jehoshafat tuh laekhu kya bakhung zah Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang bakhung hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Levi phin Kohath hae te Korah hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha thehoysah khylan myarya ccae lan roisaw hae zah a thadyn hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Awkhua takaw te tho hae zah Tekoa ramkaw lang a cceih hae; a ccia lya hae khe Jehoshafat nynh thadyn zah, “Pou Juda hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn, ka bya hynh ngaetua oh! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha zyn oh lah, tynkaring lan na thadyn kho cih oh; a profeh hae kha zyn oh lah, nae laan nae sui a ua cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae kha tuanaw a ngia kou hae te, rhawkaw hae malang a ccia lya hae khe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuabya hotua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize atynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a sungsahnaw tuh zungzae atyn,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hlaw a sah cih hae paw te athyaapaw ccaankunaw te the a hoysah cih hae paw kha a nung hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin nynh hlawsahnaw te thehoysahnaw kha he a tho hae tuh, Judah hae tuk khylan oun ccianua hae paw Ammon hae, Moab hae te Seir Mua e ccungccaw hae kha rawsete <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh buhkhawtu hae a nungnua hae keiccuze minmin tuh rhaw a shung hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize Ammon hae te Moab hae nynh Seir Mua e ccungccaw hae kha tuk hae zah marya a ro hae; Seir kya um hae paw kha he a thangsah hae te, mimaw te mimaw tukkuh hae zah pong a chih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah hae tuh ramkaw e rhawvianaw innhangpaw kya a thua hae te, ccungccaw zapi hae kha a do hae; tuh-e hae tuh lu kheit san lue leite, laekhu kya ahuekuhpaw michi rhua lang a tang hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehoshafat te a ccungccaw hae nynh rhaw hae kya-e luadepaw uccaw kha lawku lan he a cceih hae tuh, sahiin patae, uccaw hae, boeining hae te aphutepaw uccaw hae kha muih hae zah a phu kho lei lan hae ciate a lawku hae. Luadepaw uccaw tuh myarya alung keiccuze a lawnaw hae nin thum cia a rokhaekuh hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Nin palinaw nin khe Berakah Accya kya pumkuh hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha the a hoysah hae; tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh atunin cia Berakah Accya a ci hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tetuh Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn tuh Jehoshafat nynh malang cciapah hae zah lungpawte Jerusalem lang a ki hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih rhaw hae kha taepah hae zah mih lungpawsah hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tintang, tang-oi khuakute mungkae tu hae zah Jerusalem lang, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang a cceih hae. <verse number="29" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel rhaw hae a tuk hae cipaw kha ram takyh e peenaw hae balyn nynh a thae hae tuh, Pachia raw kha a rih hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />A Pachia nynh teitei langte balyn daenaw a pya keiccuze Jehoshafat peenaw tuh adae.</para>
  <para style="s">Jehoshafat Uknaw Athangnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:41-50">1Si 22.41-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuhcite Jehoshafat nynh Judah ram kha a uk. Jehoshafat tuh sung thum kum pangaw he acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum kuin lae pangaw a uk. A nung min tuh Azubah cikuh zah Shilhi ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Aning nynh a paaw Asa laanpi kha zui zah tuh-e laanpi kyate cciasei leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a rae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuhzemah ahangpaw hmin hae kha roh khyh hae; ccungccaw hae nynh mih minpaaw hae Pachia tungvaw kya mih thinlung kha nung loh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jehoshafat nynh rya a lawpaw kha atakaw te athangnaw cia a cyipaw balyn tuh Hanani ccapaw Jehu nynh a zeipaw Phungpaw ccauh kya zei hae zah, tuh-e tuh Israel Siapharan hae Ccauh kya a ccakhung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />E koute Judah siapharan Jehoshafat tuh hoyleinaw a raetupaw Israel siapharan Ahaziah ryte ccawkunaw a rae hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Tarshish khua lang a cceih cih paw sanphalung hae kha a raekheih hae; Eziongeber kya sanphalung hae kha a rae hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Te Mareshah khua umpaw Dodavahu ccapaw Eliezer nynh Jehoshafat kha rawsete profehbya ho zah, “Ahaziah ryte na mungku oh keiccuze na rae vae hae paw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a roh cih,” a ci. Te sanphalung hae tuh roh hae zah Tarshish khua lang cceih kho vae khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Jehoram Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 8:17-24">2Si 8.17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoshafat tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah David khua khe a minpaaw hae ryte a uu hae; a ccapaw Jehoram tuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoshafat ccapaw Jehoram a uno hae tuh: Azariah, Jehiel, Zekhariah, Azariah, Mikhael te Shefatiah nynh thua hae; e hae balyn tuh Judah siapharan Jehoshafat ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Mih paaw nynh minmin kha lasung patae, sui, ngun te amee rupaw uccaw hae te Judah ram e koihpaw khua hae kha a pya hae; thuasalama peenaw kha tuh Jehoram kha a pya, pawccecize aning tuh ccatawccaw nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoram nynh a paaw bawitungkhung kya kae zah a uknaw he a tynsah te, a uno hae balyn te Israel bawi hae abang kha thaloi te a chia hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoram tuh sung thum kum ning acih te ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kya kum tarya a uk. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahab ccanung kha zu lang a hoiku keiccuze Ahab ciihan nynh a la cyi hawte, Israel siapharan hae laanpi kha a zui. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhzemah David te a ciihan hae kha maeeinn zungzae kae pya cih oh cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh byakinkuh zah David ryte a la raepaw byakinnaw keiccuze aning nynh David ciihan kha roh khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1Si 11.36</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Edom nynh Dounaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoram she lyakhe Edom hae nynh Judah uknaw kha rawse hae zah mimaw nynh siapharan kha a khangku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:40">Gen 27.40</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh Jehoram tuh a rhawbawi hae te a marangle hae balyn ryte rhawtuk lan a cceih hae. Khuazi khe thokuh zah amaw te a marangle rhawbawi hae a koihlu hae paw Edom hae kha a tuk hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Edom hae nynh Judah uknaw kha atunin cia a dou hae. Tuh ccyh lyakhe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, a minpaaw hae Pachia kha a vua keiccuze Libnah khua nynh mah Jehoram uknaw kha a dou.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elijah Ccaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Judah muaram hae kyakhe ahangpaw hmin hae kha rae zah, Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha lungzi leinaw kalan cciakhae hae zah Judah hae kha a cciasah sei hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Profeh Elijah kyate Jehoram kalan ccaw yn thua zah: “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na paaw David Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nang nynh na paaw Jehoshafat laanpi te Judah siapharan Asa laanpi kha na zui khyh, <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel siapharan hae laanpi kha na zui zah, Ahab ciihan nynh Israel kha lungzi leinaw kalan a cciakhae hawte, Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha lungzi leinaw kalan na cciakhae hae zah, namaw laeze ahoyhua hae paw na paaw ciihan hae, na uno hae kha na chia hae keiccuze, <verse number="14" style="v" />dotua, na ccungccaw hae, na ccaaw hae, na zu hae te na hoipaw uccaw balyn tungvaw khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh myarya lepaw shethya a thuasah cih, <verse number="15" style="v" />nang tuh myarya ccihpaw vue ccinaw na hoi cih zah, tuh-e ccinaw keiccuze na ring tuh nin kheit laeze nin kheit houhouh a pou cih, a ci,” cite a hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jehoram kha rawsete Ethiopia hae te a naekuh hae paw Arab hae te Filistin hae kha mih thin a riasah hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin nynh Judah ram kha ccianua thung hae zah a thiing hae, siapharan inn kya a muih hae paw uccaw balyn te siapharan a zu a ccaaw hae kha, a ccasoipaw Jehoahaz laelan, lu kheit san a laehy lei lan a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoram Ccinaw te Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />E hae balyn koute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jehoram vue kha a dan kho leipaw ccinaw khate a ccisah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kum ning koute tuh-e ccinaw keiccuze a ring tuh toikuh zah a pynsaw myarya ccih lante a chih. A minpaaw hae hanlan maeephupi leih a la tuapya hae hawte, a ccungccaw hae nynh amaw kha sawtuanaw pyate maeephupi tuapah khyh hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehoram tuh sung thum kum ning acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum tarya a uk. A chi lya tuh humhung mah a ngaethah khyh. David khua kya a uu hae, thuasalama siapharan hae shawku kya uh khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ahaziah Peenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 8:25-29">2Si 8.25-29</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:21-28">9.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae nynh asoi huaccepaw a ccapaw Ahaziah kha amaw ccelang siapharan lang a khang hae; pawccecize Arab hae ryte ryahmin lang oun cceih hae paw rhawkaw hae nynh atawccaw huapaw a ccapaw hae balyn kha a chia vae hae. Tukeiccuze Jehoram ccapaw Ahaziah nynh Judah siapharan lang a tang vae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah nynh sung pali kum ning he acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kya kum kheit a uk. A nung min tuh Athaliah cikuh zah, Omri a mintanung nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />A nung tuh ahoy leipaw rae lan tuanaw a pyatu athua keiccuze Ahaziah tuh Ahab ciihan nynh a zuipaw laanpi kha a zuibua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahab ciihan nynh a la cyi hawte, aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae; pawccecize a paaw a chih koute Ahab innbyn hae tuh Ahaziah a ronaw lang tuanaw a pyatu hae nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh tuanaw a pya hae paw kha aning nynh zui zah, Siria siapharan Hazael kha tuk khylan Israel siapharan Ahab ccapaw Jehoram ryte Ramoth-gilead lang a cceih hae. Siria hae nynh Joram kha vaemaw a muesah hae, <verse number="6" style="v" />Siria siapharan Hazael kha a tuk lyaze, Ramah kya a muepaw vaemaw kha dansaku khylan Jezreel khua lang a ki. Jezreel khua kya umpaw Ahab ccapaw Joram tuh a cci keiccuze via khylan Judah siapharan Jehoram ccapaw Ahaziah tuh a cceihbung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahaziah nynh Joram via lan a la cciapaw tuh Pachia nynh Ahaziah a ccaw nawlan a la paccynpaw nynh thua. Pawccecize Ahaziah tuh tuin kya he a thua te, Joram ryte pou hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Ahab innbyn a rohtu lang chitui a thuhpaw Nimshi, Jehu ccapaw te a tungkuh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehu nynh Ahab innbyn kha bya he a pia tuh, Ahaziah a do-oihtu hae Judah bawi hae te Ahaziah uno hae mih ccapaw hae ryte tungkuh hae zah minmin kha a chia hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahaziah kha ccung zah Samaria kya a reku lyakhe a kyng hae, te Jehu kalan cciakhae hae zah a chia hae. Amaw kha a uu hae, pawccecize minmin nynh, “Aning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thinlung balyn te a ccungpaw Jehoshafat ccapaw nynh thua,” a ci hae. Te Ahaziah innbyn kya ram a uk kho lanpaw lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="s">Athaliah nynh Bawitungkhung A Lawde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:1-3">2Si 11.1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahaziah nung Athaliah nynh a ccapaw a chipaw kha he a nyh tuh, thokuh zah siapharan innbyn hae balyn kha a chia hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan ccanung Jehoshabeath nynh Ahaziah ccapaw Joash kha lah zah chia athua vae cih hae paw siapharan ccapaw hae kyate zya ruh zah amaw te a do-oihtu kha inaw khaan kya a nung hae. Tuhcite Siapharan Jehoram ccanung, ranpibawi Jehoiada zu Jehoshabeath tuh Ahaziah ccianung athua keiccuze Athaliah nynh Joash kha a chia khyh nawlan zya a thuruh; <verse number="12" style="v" />Athaliah nynh ram a uk lya, kum taruh lungkhu Joash tuh Pachia inn kya thuruh hae zah minmin ryte a um hae.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuasalama kum sarinaw kum khe, Jehoiada tuh a rawthungsakuh zah, aza uktu rhawbawi hae, Jehoram ccapaw Azariah, Jehohanan ccapaw Ishmael, Obed ccapaw Azariah, Adaiah ccapaw Maaseiah te Zikhri ccapaw Elishafat ryte byakinkunaw a rae hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah ram po lekuh lan cceih hae zah Judah khua miakaw kya-e Levi phin hae te Israel innbyn hae raveih kya-e lu hae kha pum hae zah Jerusalem lang a cceih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te a pumkuh hae paw balyn nynh siapharan ryte Pachia inn kyakhe byakinnaw a rae hae. Jehoiada nynh minmin kha, “Hein kya siapharan ccapaw a um! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David ccapaw hae te asekuh lante bya a kinku vae hawte, aning nynh uk sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sa 7.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Hynhte na cyih cih oh: sabbath nin kya rya na hoi oh paw ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae pum thum pum kheit tuh sakoih ngawtu na thua cih oh, <verse number="5" style="v" />pum thum pum kheit tuh siapharan inn kya na um cih oh zah, pum thum pum kheit tuh Aleihpaw Sakoih kya na um cih oh; te ccungccaw balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn voidu lungkhu na um cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae te ryalahpaw Levi phin hae laelan, humhung mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang tee nan sah; minmin tuh a thyaa hae keiccuze a tee kho cih hae, thuasalama ccangpaw ccungccaw balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kaw kha a ngae cih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi phin hae tuh mih zunghe kha ccarou ccyngkute siapharan kha a koihlu cih hae; inn lungkhu lang a teepaw miakaw tuh chia athua cih. Siapharan nynh a pou a tee vae ze, amaw kya na um cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joash Siapharan lang Tangnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:9-12">2Si 11.9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ranpibawi Jehoiada nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte Levi phin hae te Judah hae balyn nynh marya a cyi hae; minmin lu kheit cci nynh sabbath nin kya rya a hoi cih lei hae paw mih ccungccaw hae te sabbath nin kya rya a hoi cih hae paw mih ccungccaw hae kha a cciakhae hae; pawccecize Jehoiada nynh rya a nee hae paw aphu hae kha roh khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia inn kya umpaw, David Siapharan kya-e ccoi hae te khawriaphua adihpaw te alepaw hae kha ranpibawi Jehoiada nynh rhawbawi hae kha a pya hae; <verse number="10" style="v" />mih kuih kya zunghe ccarou a ccyngkuh hae paw ccungccaw hae balyn kha siapharan rhawviatu hae lang, inn alia langte inn thahlang cia, inn kya-e silawhang po voilu lan a nung hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Jehoiada nynh siapharan ccapaw kha yn poukhae zah bawilukhung khungsah zah byakinnaw ccauh kha a pya; siapharan lang khang hae zah Jehoiada te a ccapaw hae nynh chitui thuh hae zah, “Siapharan tuh a hiinshe sae vae sah!” cite a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Athaliah Chianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh ccue hae zah siapharan a thehoysah hae paw roi accaepaw kha Athaliah nynh he a thae tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang ccungccaw hae kalan a tee; <verse number="13" style="v" />he a do tuh, siapharan tuh teenaw kya a tungpi pe thadyn zah, rhawbawi hae te mungkae tu hae paw tuh siapharan pe um hae zah, ram lungkhu e ccungccaw balyn tuh lungpawte mungkae tu hae zah, hlawsahthya hae paw nynh khuakupaw mih uccaw hae khate lungtuanaw poi a tua hae paw kha a muih. Athaliah nynh a boeining kha seii zah, “Dounaw nynh thua! Dounaw nynh thua!” cite a sia. <verse number="14" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae uktu lang khang athua hae paw rhawbawi hae kha ranpibawi Jehoiada nynh poukhae hae zah minmin kyakhe, “Aning hynh rhawkaw hae laku kyate poukhae oh; amaw a zuipaw miakaw kha thaloi te theih oh,” a cipya hae. Pawccecize ranpibawi nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu kya amaw kha theih nan oh,” a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh a kyng hae; te siapharan inn Marang Sakoih teenaw kya tee zah, tuin kya a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoiada nynh minmin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw athua nawlan hae, amaw te ccungccaw zapi hae balyn te siapharan laku kya byakinnaw kha a rae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te ccungccaw hae balyn tuh Baal beikinn lang cceih hae zah a ro hae; a silawhang hae, a zohtuh hae kha khaleih koi hae zah Baal ranpibawi Mattan kha silawhang hae malang khe a chia hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a do-oihtu lang rya a la naw hae paw Levi phin ranpibawi hae kha Jehoiada nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a do-oihtu lang a nung hae; David nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte minmin nynh lungpawte hlawsahpaw rya kha a lah cih hae zah, Moses phungbya kya azeiku hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan maee-ute silawnaw kha a rae cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thyaa leinaw hankhakheit a hoipaw miakaw nynh a tee khyh nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn sakoih kyakhe sakoih ngawtu hae kha a nung hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Rhawbawi hae, bawi hae, ccungccaw uktu hae te ram lungkhu e ccungccaw balyn kha ko hae zah, minmin nynh siapharan kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyate cciakhae bung hae zah, siapharan inn thahlang sakoih kyate a tee hae. Minmin nynh siapharan kha bawilukhung a khungsah hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ram lungkhu e ccungccaw balyn tuh mih lungpaw; Athaliah kha thaloi te a theih kou hae te, khua tuh daebabi lan a um vae.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Joash nynh Beikinn A Cyithui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:21-12:21">2Si 11.21—12.21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joash tuh kum sari acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum sung pali a uk. A nung min tuh Zibiah cikuh zah Beersheba khuanung nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ranpibawi Jehoiada she lungkhu balyn tuh Joash nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jehoiada nynh zu zuning hoipah zah ccapaw hae te ccanung hae kha a saah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccyh sosoh koute Joash nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha cyithui lan a paccynku. <verse number="5" style="v" />Aning nynh ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae kha pum hae zah, “Judah ram e khua hae kalan la cceih oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn cyithui nawlan Israel hae balyn kya-e phua kha kum kheit vae kheit la khoi oh; arangte ryalah oh,” a cipya hae. Thuasalama Levi phin hae nynh arangte ryalah khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh lupi huapaw Jehoiada kha ko zah, “Byakinnaw bu hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses liate Israel ccungccaw zapi hae nynh a pya hae paw ngunto hawte, Levi phin hae nynh Judah ram te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kya-e phua kha a thuakhae nawlan hae pawccemou na naw khyh hae?” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Exo 30.11-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw hoyleinung Athaliah ccaaw hae nynh Pachia inn kha roh hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya-e hlupaw uccaw hae balyn kha Baal pachia hae elang a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhcite siapharan nynh kawtho zah, minmin nynh thingkua ccangkheit rae hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e sakoih atolang khe a nung hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia ryalahtu Moses nynh ramkaw kya Israel hae kya a la khoipaw ngunto thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan nae thuakhae cih oh cite Judah ram te Jerusalem khua kya a thaesah hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Cciakhaetu hae balyn te ccungccaw hae balyn tuh mih lungpaw zah mih ngunto kha ccyng hae zah thingkua abia mawlaezung a sang hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi phin hae nynh thingkua kha siapharan kuihkaw e bawi kalan a cciakhae takyh hae te, a lungkhu kya phua patae a umpaw he a muih hae ze, siapharan a ryaccinkhanpaw te ranpibawi lepaw kya-e bawi tuh leih oun cceih hae zah phua kha a lah kou hae te, thingkua kha amaw umnaw hmin kya bua a nung hae. Tuhcite nin takyh cyih hae zah phua kha patae a ccakhung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Siapharan te Jehoiada nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn rya a lahtu hae kalan a pya hae, minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn cyithui khylan pazan thya hae paw, lehccama hae kha a hoh hae, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn cyithui khylan sivaw te sohin kya ryalah hae paw kha mah a hoh hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhcite ryalaw lan a naw hae paw nynh rya kha lah hae zah, inn cyithuipaw rya tuh a cceihthya, te Pachia inn tuh amaw mamin lang cyihthui hae zah a tynsah hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />A thangsah hae te, alaepaw phua tuh siapharan te Jehoiada kalan a cciakhae hae, tuh-e phua tuhte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn hanlan angphe hae, beiknaw lanpaw te silawnaw lanpaw angphe hae, angsaw hae, sui angphe hae te ngun angphe hae kha a rae hae. Jehoiada a she lungkhu balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya maee-ute silawnaw kha tyty a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joash A Lungzi Leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehoiada tuh taw vae zah a she dianaw thua vae zah a chih; aning tuh kum za kheit sung thum acih te a chih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning tuh Israel hae kya thuasah, Pachia hanlan te a inn hanlan thuasah rya hoypaw a law keiccuze David khua kya siapharan hae kyakhe a uubua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada a chih koute Judah ram e bawi hae tuh oun thua hae zah siapharan kha sawtuanaw a pya hae; te siapharan nynh mih bya kha a ngae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn, mih minpaaw hae Pachia kha vua hae zah Asherah te zohtuh hae kha rya a lawpya hae. E mih cyiseinaw keiccuze Judah ram te Jerusalem tungvaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw accah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan kikhae khylan profeh hae kha a sawpya hae; tuh-e profeh hae nynh minmin kha rawsete ccaekia a khan hae zemah ngae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Pachia muisaw nynh ranpibawi Jehoiada ccapaw Zekhariah kha a thuanua; aning nynh ccungccaw hae laeze ahangnaw khe thadyn zah, “Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Nanning nynh nae laan nae sui a ua lei lan, pawccemou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya kha na zui khyh oh? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na vua oh keiccuze aning nynh mah nanning kha ae vua oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.20-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luk 11.51</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin nynh amaw kha phee hae zah, siapharan kaw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn voidu lungkhu khe lung te phe chih lan a deih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Zekhariah a paaw Jehoiada nynh Joash tungvaw kya thawccinaw a la hoipaw kha Siapharan Joash nynh liathui leite a ccapaw kha a chia. Zekhariah nynh a chi dyn khe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh muih sah lah, phulah vae sah!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joash Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum athang khe Siria rhawkaw hae nynh Joash kha oun ccianua thung hae. Judah ram te Jerusalem khua thua hae zah ccungccaw zapi hae laku kya-e mih bawi hae balyn kha roh hae zah luadepaw uccaw balyn kha Damaskas siapharan kalan a ky hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Siria rhawkaw hae tuh milu beihtaraw te oun ccia hae zemah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh myarya lungpaw Judah rhawkaw hae kha mih kuih kalan a pya hae, pawccecize minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih minpaaw hae Pachia kha a vua vae hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Rhaw hae nynh he a kitaw hae te, Joash tuh vaemaw myarya ccih lante a kitaw hae, ranpibawi Jehoiada ccapaw chiise kha a luasah keiccuze a ryalahtu hae nynh phee hae zah a ikhung vawlan khe a chia hae. Tuhcite chih zah David khua kya a uu hae, thuasalama siapharan hae shawku kya uh khyh hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Amaw a pheetu hae tuh Ammon minphuinpaw Shimeath ccapaw Zabad te Moab minphuinpaw Shimrith ccapaw Jehozabad nynh thua hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Joash ccapaw hae konglang te amaw rawsete hopaw bya patae te Pachia inn sakthuinaw kong kha Siapharan hae Ccauh Ccaesahnaw ccauh kya a zei hae. Te a ccapaw Amaziah nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Amaziah Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:1-22">2Si 14.1-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amaziah tuh kum kuin lae pangaw acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum kuin lae takua a uk. A nung min tuh Jehoaddan cikuh zah Jerusalem khuanung nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi, tuhzemah ahmepaw thinlung tetuh thua khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Siapharan kawhoinaw kha a kuih kya tynkaring lan he a um takaw te, a paaw, siapharan a la theihtu hae a ryalahtu hae kha a chia hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Moses phungbya ccauh kyaze, “Ccaaw hae ccelang nungpaaw hae kha chia thua lan khyh hae, nungpaaw hae ccelang ccaaw hae kha chia thua lan khyh hae; mimaw seinaw hanlan rou nynh chia athua cih hae,” cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pya thyhte, a theihtu hae paw mih ccaaw hae kha tuh theih khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Deu 24.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Edom hae kha Chianaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:7">2Si 14.7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaziah nynh Judah ccungccaw hae kha pum hae zah Judah phin te Benjamin phin hae hanlan ccungccaw athong uktu hae te aza uktu hae kha mih puizia raveih kya a nung hae. Kum kuin te palung lang kha pum hae zah ccoi te khawriaphua a ccyngkuh kho hae paw, rhaw a tuk kho vae paw popaw rhawkaw hae tuh cciing thum a um hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel ram e athungpaw rhawkaw cciing kheit kha mah ngun talent za kheit te a hoh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia ccungccapaw tuh a kalan yn thua zah, “Pou siapharan, Israel rhawkaw hae kha na kya cciasah bua nan hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Israel hae—e Efraim hae balyn kya um khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na cceih zah rhawtuknaw kya na thungsaku zemah, Pachia nynh rhaw hae malang khe ae khulia cih; pawccecize Pachia tuh bawm khonaw te vua khonaw thungnaw a hoi,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaziah nynh Pachia ccungccapaw kha, “Israel rhawkaw hae kalan ka pya vae hae paw talent za kheit kong hynh pawtemou ka cyih vae cih?” a cipya. Pachia ccungccapaw nynh, “E laeze patae alung lan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ae pya kho,” cite a khung. <verse number="10" style="v" />Efraim ram kyate amaw kalan oun thua hae paw rhawkaw hae kha mih inn lang kisah khylan Amaziah nynh a saw hae. Tukeiccuze Judah hae tungvaw myarya mih thinria zah thin-ute mih inn lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaziah nynh a rawthungsakuh zah a ccungccaw hae kha a cciakhae hae; Loi Accya langkhe cceih hae zah Seir ccungccaw hae thong haw kha a chia hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah hae nynh ccangpaw ccungccaw thong haw kha ahiinte kyng hae zah Sela khua e chia dung langkhe a cciakhae hae, te chia dung kyate vuabung hae zah mih balynte zoihtatyh lan pong tui hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Amaziah nynh rhawtuknaw lang amaw kya cciasah bua leite a kisah hae paw rhawkaw hae nynh Judah ram e khua hae kha Samaria kyate Beth-horon kyacia a tuk hae; tuin kya umpaw ccungccaw thong thum kha theih hae zah luadepaw uccaw patae kha a lawku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaziah tuh Edom hae a chianaw hae kyate he yn ki te, Seir ccungccaw hae kya-e pachia hae kha yn phukuh zah a pachia lang a nungku hae, te mynkhuhpaw upyate a beik hae. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Amaziah tungvaw a thinria zah profeh lu kheit a sawnua, tuh-e profeh nynh, “Mih ccungccaw hae kha na kuih kyate a luesah kho lei hae paw, ccangpaw minphuin hae pachia hae kha pawccemou na beik hae?” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama bya a ho cciamang lyakhe siapharan nynh, “Nang hynh siapharan tuanaw a pyatu lang kae nung tou? Zya dae! Pawccemou chiaku na ry?” a cipya. Tukeiccuze profeh tuh zya a dae vae, thuasalama aning nynh, “E rya hynh na lah zah tuanaw kae pyapaw kha na ngae khyh keiccuze Pachia nynh nang kha ro lan a tuaku vae cipaw ka ny,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel nynh Judah A Tae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:8-20">2Si 14.8-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah siapharan Amaziah nynh tuanaw a ngia kou hae te, Israel siapharan Jehu ccapaw Jehoahaz a ccapaw Jehoash kalan khe ccungccaw saw zah, “Yn cceih lah, lu kheit te lu kheit hawiliakute doku tua sih,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel siapharan Jehoash nynh Judah siapharan Amaziah kalan byataw zah, “Lebanon mua e hinpawbu nynh Lebanon mua e sidar thingku kalan byataw zah, ‘Na ccanung kha ka ccapaw zu lang yn pya,’ a cipya; te Lebanon e loramsaw sa kheit nynh po a ccia lyakhe, hinpawbu kha a syde. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang nynh, ‘Dotua, Edom ram kha ka tae vae,’ na ci zah, pookute na thinlung na hangsahku. Innvaw khe zya umkuh; namaw te Judah ram tuh khuliaku khylan pawccemou vawsawnaw kha na ccungku?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama Amaziah nynh ngae ry khyh—pawccecize minmin nynh Edom pachia hae kha a ccung hae keiccuze minmin kha rhaw hae kuih kalan pya khylan Pachia nynh a cyipaw nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel siapharan Jehoash tuh cceihthung zah, Judah ram Beth-shemesh kyakhe Judah siapharan Amaziah te hawiliakute rhaw a tukkuh hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel nynh Judah kha tae zah, mih inn raveih lang pong a ccue hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel siapharan Jehoash nynh Judah siapharan Amaziah kha Beth-shemesh kyakhe a kyng; Amaziah tuh Jehoash ccapaw, Jehoash tuh Ahaziah ccapaw nynh thua; te Jerusalem lang cciakhae zah Jerusalem khualungrua kha Efraim Koikua kyate Apaki Koikua kyacia, dong za pali a ting. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pachia inn kya a umpaw sui te ngun miakaw, angphe hae balyn kha lah zah, Obed-edom kha mah a kyng; siapharan inn kya-e sisua hae te aamahkhan ccungccaw hae kha mah a kyng hae; te Samaria khua lang a ki.</para>
  <para style="s1">Amaziah Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah siapharan Joash ccapaw Amaziah tuh Israel siapharan Jehoahaz ccapaw Jehoash a chih koute kum haw lae pangaw a hiin ung. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Amaziah nynh a cyipaw kha atakaw te athangnaw cia, Judah te Israel Siapharan hae Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Amaziah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate ccanglang a maeku ccyh kyate tho zah Jerusalem kya amaw pheenaw rya kha lah hae zah, Amaziah tuh Lakhish khua lang a ccue. Thuasalama Lakhish khua lang ccungccaw deehuisah hae zah, tuin kya a chia hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Marang tungvaw khangte kikhae hae zah, David khua khe a minpaaw hae ryte a uukheih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Uzziah Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:21-22">2Si 14.21-22</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">15.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah ccungccaw hae balyn nynh kum haw lae taruh acih vae paw Uzziah kha ko hae zah, a paaw Amaziah ccelang siapharan lang a khangku hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Siapharan tuh a minpaaw hae ryte a ih kou hae te, Uzziah nynh Eloth khua kha raethui zah Judah ram lungkhu bua a nung. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning nynh kum haw lae taruh acih te ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kya sung pangaw kum ning a uk. A nung min tuh Jekoliah cikuh zah Jerusalem khuanung nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />A paaw Amaziah nynh a la cyi hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrinaw a ccangpahtu Zekhariah she lya tuh, Uzziah tuh Pachia kalan a naekuh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a naeku lungkhu tuh Pachia nynh laansui-uanaw a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzziah nynh cceih zah Filistin hae kha a tuk hae, Gath khualungrua, Jabneh khualungrua te Ashdod khualungrua kha a tingbung hae; Ashdod ram lungkhu te Filistin hae laku kya hmin ccangpaw kyakhe khua hae kha a rae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pachia nynh Filistin hae, Gurbaal kya um hae paw Arab hae te Meunim hae kha rawsete amaw kha a bawm. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammon hae nynh Uzziah kha ngunto a pya hae, aning tuh myarya athungpaw lang a tang keiccuze a minthaannaw tuh Izip ram cia heize azeihkuh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Uzziah nynh Jerusalem kya Apaki Koikua, Accya Koikua te khualungrua Akouleihnaw Sakoih kyakhe rhawvianaw innhangpaw hae kha sak zah a koih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Shefelah kya te bialae khe sahiin patae a hoi keiccuze ramkaw khe rhawvianaw innhangpaw hae kha sak zah tuisung patae a thae, te loopho rya kha myarya a rypaw athua keiccuze sangpyng hae te lae ahoynaw hmin hae kyakhe loopho hae te misu khokhu do-oihtu hae kha a nung hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Uzziah nynh rhawkawphu, rhaw a tuk kho vae paw rhawkaw hae kha a hoi, siapharan a rhawbawi hae kya-e lu kheit athuapaw Hananiah kuihkaw a um hae paw ryaccinkhan Jeiel te rhawbawi Maaseiah nynh milu ccazing a law hae thyhte rhawkaw hae tuh aphuphute a um hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Puizia raveih kya-e lu hae athua hae paw athungpaw rhawkaw hae milu abalyn tuh thong ning za taruh acih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Minmin kuihkaw khe, rhaw hae kha tuk khylan siapharan a bawm khopaw, rhaw a tuk khopaw myarya thungpaw rhawkaw hae cciing thum thong sari za pangaw a um hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Uzziah nynh rhawkaw hae balyn kha khawriaphua, ccoi, sivawlukhung, sivaw angki, li te zaenawpaw lung hae kha a pya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Athyapaw ryalahtu hae nynh a rae hae paw the te lung pipi hae kawnawpaw seh hae kha mah Jerusalem khua e rhawvianaw innhangpaw hae te khualungrua apaki hae vawlan khe a nung hae. Tuhcite aning tuh athungpaw lang a tang mawlaezung ngaeangthua lan ciate a bawm hae keiccuze a minthaannaw tuh azeihkuh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Lysakunaw te Lungzi Leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama Uzziah tuh athungpaw lang he yn tang tuh, amaw a ro nawlan yn lysakuh vae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia tungvaw sei zah, mynkhuhpaw unawpaw silawhang vawlan mynkhuhpaw kha u khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lungkhu lang a tee. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama ranpibawi Azariah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi hae arawthungpaw sung tarya ryte a nulang te a zui hae; <verse number="18" style="v" />minmin nynh Siapharan Uzziah kha kang hae zah, “Uzziah, nang nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan mynkhuhpaw kha na u lanpaw thua khyh, mynkhuhpaw a utu lang thyaasah athua hae paw Aaron ciihan ranpibawi hae nynh mynkhuhpaw kha a u cih hae. Beikinnthyaa kyate poutua; phe na cyisei vae, e hynh nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia kyate sawtuanaw kha ae thuakhaepah lan khyh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh Uzziah tuh a thinria. Mynkhuhpaw u nawlan pakephepaw kha ccyngkuh zah, ranpibawi hae tungvaw a thin he ria tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu, mynkhuhpaw unawpaw silawhang pe, ranpibawi hae malang khe a terui kya vaethya ccinaw a langkuh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ranpibawi lepaw Azariah te ranpibawi hae balyn nynh amaw kha he a do hae tuh, a terui kya vaethya ccinaw a kae. Minmin nynh arangte a poukhae hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh de a tah vae keiccuze amaw nynh mah rangsakute a pou. <verse number="21" style="v" />Siapharan Uzziah tuh a chih cia vaethya ccinaw a kae, vaethya ccinaw a kae keiccuze inn ccangpaw kya a um, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang teenaw kaw mue vae khyh. A ccapaw Jotham nynh siapharan inn kha do-oih zah, ram kya-e ccungccaw hae kha a uk hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Uzziah nynh rya a lawpaw kha atakaw te athangnaw cia Amoz ccapaw profeh Isaiah nynh a zei. <verse number="23" style="v" />Uzziah tuh a minpaaw hae ryte a ih hae; minmin nynh, “Aning tuh vaethya ccinaw a kae,” a ci hae keiccuze, siapharan hae te asekuhpaw shawku kya a minpaaw hae pe khe a uu hae. A ccapaw Jotham nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">Isa 6.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Jotham Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 15:32-38">2Si 15.32-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jotham tuh kum kuin lae pangaw acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum haw lae taruh a uk. A nung min tuh Jerushah cikuh zah Zadok ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />A paaw Uzziah nynh a la cyi hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi—<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lungkhu lang kha tuh teenua khyh. Thuasalama ccungccaw hae nynh ahoy leipaw cyisahnaw kha a rae ung hae. <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e palung sakoih kha rae zah, Ofel khualungrua kha ccavyng a tynsah. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Judah muaram kyakhe khua hae kha rae zah, ramkaw khe rhawlungrua hae te rhawvianaw innhangpaw hae kha a sak hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ammon hae siapharan te tukkuh hae zah a tae hae. Tuin kum khe Ammon hae nynh ngun talent za kheit, chanvuih kor thong haw, barli kor thong haw kha a pya hae. Kum ningnaw te kum thumnaw kya mah tuhzeih maminte Ammon hae nynh a pya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcite Jotham nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia malang khe lungzite a ccia keiccuze athungpaw ccungccaw lang a tang. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jotham nynh rya a lawpaw, rhaw a tukpaw balyn te a hiinzia tuh Judah te Israel Siapharan hae Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Kum kuin lae pangaw acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum haw lae taruh a uk. <verse number="9" style="v" />Jotham tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, David khua kya a uu hae; a ccapaw Ahaz nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Ahaz Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 16:1-4">2Si 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaz tuh kum kuin acih te ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kya kum haw lae taruh a uk. A minpaaw David hawte thua leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha rae khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel siapharan hae laanpi kha a zui. Baal pachia hae hanlan zohtuh hae kha heize laeete a rae; <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinnom ccapaw accya kyakhe silawnaw rae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae malang te a dee hae paw minphuin hae kya-e anungsikuhpaw cyisahnaw thyhte, a ccapaw hae khate heize maee-ute silawnaw a rae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahangpaw hmin hae vawlan, mua hae vawlan te hinlalyhpaw thingku kaw miakaw khe silawnaw rae zah mynkhuhpaw kha a u.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siria te Israel nynh Judah A Tae hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 16:5">2Si 16.5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia nynh Ahaz kha Siria siapharan kuih kalan a pya, aning nynh Ahaz kha tae zah a ccungccaw hae patae kha kyng hae zah Damaskas khua lang a cciakhae hae. Israel siapharan kuih kalan mah amaw kha pya thua zah, tuh-e paw nynh tae zah ccungccaw patae a chia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:1">Isa 7.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Mih minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a vua hae keiccuze Remaliah ccapaw Pekah nynh nin kheit lungkhu Judah ram kya cciing kheit thong kuin a chia, tuh-e hae balyn tuh arawthungpaw rhawkaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Athungpaw rhawkaw, Efraim phinpaw Zikhri nynh siapharan ccapaw Maaseiah, siapharan inn e rhawbawipaw Azrikam te kawhoinaw kya siapharan he a zuipaw Elkanah kha a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Profeh Oded</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae nynh mih puizia hae athua hae paw nopi hae, ccapaw hae te ccanung hae cciing ning kha kyng hae zah a cciakhae hae; mih uccaw patae kha mah luade hae zah Samaria lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Oded cikuhpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh lu kheit a um; Samaria khua lang oun cceih hae paw rhawkaw hae kha tungku lan ccianua hae zah, “Nae minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Judah tungvaw a thinria keiccuze minmin kha nae kuih kalan ae pya oh, thuasalama nanning nynh vaawlui phe phahpaw thin-unaw te minmin kha na chia vae oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Atu tuh nanning nynh Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae nopi pise hae kha nae see hae hawte uk lan na paccynku oh. Nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tungvaw seinaw na rae khyh oh tou? <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka bya hynh thaetua oh, na kyng oh zah na cciakhae oh paw nae puizia hae kha saw oh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thin-unaw myarya lepaw tuh nae tungvaw a um,” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh Efraim phin kya-e bawi hae, Johanan ccapaw Azariah, Meshillemoth ccapaw Berekhiah, Shallum ccapaw Jehizkiah te Hadlai ccapaw Amasa nynh rhawtuknaw langte oun cceih hae paw kha thadyn khaw hae zah, <verse number="13" style="v" />minmin kha, “Na kyng oh paw ccungccaw hae kha hynhlang na thuakhae lan khyh oh, pawccecize atu kae seinaw te kae cyiseinaw vawlan hin <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw cyiseinaw kha nanning nynh kae tungvaw thuakhae chih lan na paccynku oh. Kae cyiseinaw tuh myarya le vae zah Israel tungvaw thin-unaw a um vae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze rhawkaw hae nynh a kyng hae paw te a luade hae paw uccaw hae kha bawi hae te ccungccaw zapi hae malang khe a cciataw hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te mih min te a ko hae paw ccungccaw hae nynh thokuh hae zah a kyng hae paw kha ko hae zah boeining leite a um hae paw balyn kha luadepaw boeining kha a lawsahku hae; boeining lawsakuh hae zah phanah a nawsaku hae, tui te looh pya hae zah chitui a thuhsaku hae; te minmin laku e mih thawzyapaw balyn kha lann ccisakuh hae zah, mih puizia hae a umnaw hae ungcci ku khua a ci hae paw Jeriko khua langkhe a cciakhae hae. Tukoute Samaria lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="s">Assiria nynh Judah Bawm lan A Mya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 16:7-9">2Si 16.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Ahaz Siapharan nynh Assiria siapharan kalan khe bawmnaw ngia lan ccungccaw a saw. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Edom hae nynh Judah ram kha bua thiing hae zah a tae hae, ccungccaw hae kha kyng hae zah a cciakhae hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Judah ram e Shefelah te Negeb kya umpaw khua hae kha thiing hae zah Beth-shemesh, Aijalon, Gederoth, Soko te a khua taraw hae, Timnah te a khua taraw hae, te Gimzo te a khua taraw hae kha lah hae zah tuin kya a um hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel siapharan Ahaz keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Judah ram kha a nyaasah bung, pawccecize Judah ram kya hoyleinaw kha lungsah thung zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw a lungzi khyh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Assiria siapharan Tilgath-pilneser nynh ccianua zah thawzung pya leite a tuaa a sah. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize Ahaz nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn, siapharan inn te bawi hae inn e uccaw hae kha luade hae zah Assiria siapharan kha ngunto a pya; thuasalama aning nynh Ahaz kha bawm lae khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahaz Seinaw te A Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />E Ahaz siapharan tuh a lungriathae ccyh lyakhe mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw lungzinaw houh hoi khyh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize amaw a taetu Damaskas pachia hae kalan khe silawnaw rae zah, “Siria siapharan hae kya-e pachia hae nynh minmin kha a bawm hae keiccuze kae hynh mah yn bawmbua nawlan hae, mih kalan silawnaw ka rae cih,” a ci. Thuasalama tuh-e pachia hae tuh Ahaz te Israel hae balyn a ro nawlan hae nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahaz nynh Pachia inn e angphe hae kha suelua hae zah, Pachia inn e angphe hae kha palae tui lan a koi hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn thuakaw hae kha khaw zah Jerusalem khua apaki miakaw khe silawhang hae kha a raeku. <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah ram e khua miakaw kyakhe ccangpaw pachia hae hanlan mynkhuhpaw upya nawlan ahangpaw hmin hae kha rae zah a minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thin a riasah. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Ahaz nynh a cyipaw te a hiinzia balyn tuh atakaw te athangnaw cia Judah te Israel Siapharan hae Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahaz tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, Jerusalem khua kya a uu hae; thuasalama Israel siapharan hae kya-e shawku hae kalan cciakhae khyh hae. A ccapaw Hezekiah nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:28">Isa 14.28</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Hezekiah Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:1-3">2Si 18.1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah tuh kum kuin lae pangaw acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah Jerusalem kya kum kuin lae takua a uk. A nung tuh Abijah cikuh zah Zekhariah ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />A minpaaw David nynh a la cyi hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi.</para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn A Thyaasah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram a uknaw masaty kum, masaty sawpaw khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn thuakaw hae kha hung zah a raethui hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae kha cciakhae hae zah nithua lang e voidu lungkhu khe pum hae zah, <verse number="5" style="v" />minmin kyakhe, “Levi phin hae, ka bya hynh thaetua oh! Naemaw toulou kha thyaasakuh oh lah, nae minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha thyaasah oh, athyaapaw hmin kyate athupaw kha vua oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize ah minpaaw hae tuh lungzinaw hoi khyh hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae vae hae; amaw kha vua hae zah mih mae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> umnaw kyate ccanglang hawi hae zah mih nulang a sangsah vae hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Beikinn tee takawnaw e thuakaw hae kha khaw hae zah maeekhua hae kha a the hae, athyaapaw hmin kya Israel Pachia kalan mynkhuhpaw kha u khyh hae zah maee-ute silawnaw mah rae khyh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh Judah te Jerusalem tungvaw ccah zah, nae mit te na muih vae oh hawte, huapaw lang, ngaeangthuapaw lang te saryanaw roi sawnuapaw lang a rae vae hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze e hanlan hynh ah paaw hae tuh thaloi te chih hae zah, ah ccapaw hae, ah ccanung hae te ah zu hae tuh kyng hae zah a cciakhae hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Atu tuh a thinrianaw myarya lepaw kha aening kyate ccanglang a maeku nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia ryte byakinnaw rae lan ka thinlung kya a um. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ccapaw hae, atu tuh sawphahkute um nan vae oh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha amaw malang thadyn lan, amaw ryalawpya lan, a ryalahtu lang tang lan te amaw kalan mynkhuhpaw u lan ae po vae oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh Levi phin hae tuh a thokuh hae, Kohath ciihan hae kyate Amasai ccapaw Mahath, Azariah ccapaw Joel; Merari ciihan hae kyate Abdi ccapaw Kish, Jehallelel ccapaw Azariah; Gershon ciihan hae kyate Zimmah ccapaw Joah, Joah ccapaw Eden; <verse number="13" style="v" />Elizafan ciihan hae kyate Shimri te Jeuel; Asaf ciihan hae kyate Zekhariah te Mattaniah; <verse number="14" style="v" />Heman ciihan hae kyate Jehuel te Shimei; Jeduthun ciihan hae kyate Shemaiah te Uzziel. <verse number="15" style="v" />Mih uno hae kha pum hae zah mimaw te mimaw a thyaasaku hae, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte, siapharan nynh kaw a pya hae hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha thyaasah khylan a tee hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha thyaasah khylan a lungkhu lang tee hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lungkhu a muih hae paw athyaa leipaw uccaw balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn voidu kalan a poukhae hae; te Levi phin hae nynh lah hae zah Kidron Vaw lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Masaty sawpaw, nin kheit nin khe thyaasahnaw kha tho hae zah tuh-e sawpaw nin tarya nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn tee takawnaw khaan kya a thua hae; nin tarya lungkhu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha thyaasah hae zah, masaty sawpaw nin haw lae taruh nin khe a lyn hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Hezekiah Siapharan kalan tee hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha abalynte, maee-ute silawnawpaw silawhang te a angphe hae balyn, nungpyapaw sanlou nungnawpaw ccaboi te a angphe hae balyn kha kae thyaasah vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahaz Siapharan nynh lungzinaw hoi leite a uk lyaze a vuapaw angphe balyn kha kae paccyn zah kae thyaasah vae; dotua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang malang a um hae,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn kya Bua Beiknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Hezekiah Siapharan tuh awkhua takaw te tho zah khua lungkhu e bawi hae kha pum hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang a cceihthung. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ram hanlan, beikinnthyaa hanlan te Judah hanlan seithyaanaw silawnaw kha rae nawlan tangnuapaw sa sari, tuutepaw sa sari, tuutaw sa sari te miaatepaw sa sari kha a cciakhae hae. Aaron ciihan hae ranpibawi hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang vawlan silawnaw rae lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tangnuapaw hae kha theih hae zah ranpibawi hae nynh achii kha lah hae zah silawhang kha a thei hae; tuutepaw hae kha theih hae zah mih chii khate silawhang kha a thei hae; tuutaw hae kha mah theih hae zah mih chii khate silawhang kha a thei hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te seithyaanaw silawnaw lanpaw miaatepaw hae kha siapharan te ccungccaw zapi hae kalan a cciakhae hae; mih kuih kha tuh-e hae vawlan a khang hae, <verse number="24" style="v" />te ranpibawi hae nynh tuh-e miaatepaw hae kha theih hae zah mih chii khate Israel hae balyn hanlan seingaethyanaw rae khylan silawhang vawlan khe seishawnaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />David te a profeh Gad te profeh Nathan nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte, lanchi, tintang te tang-oi a khua hae paw Levi phin hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya a nung hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate kawbya tuh a profeh hae kha mangte yn thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Levi phin hae tuh David kya-e khuakupaw uccaw hae kha ccyngkute thadyn hae zah ranpibawi hae tuh mungkae hae kha ccyngkute a thadyn hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tetuh Hezekiah nynh silawhang vawlan khe maee-ute silawnaw rae lan kaw a pya hae. Maee-ute silawnaw kha he a rae takaw hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hlawsahnaw kha tho hae zah mungkae tu biate, Israel siapharan David kya-e khuakupaw uccaw hae kha a khuaku bia hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi balyn nynh a beik hae, hlawsahtu hae nynh hlawsah hae zah mungkae tu hae paw nynh mungkae a tu hae; e hae balyn hynh maee-ute silawnaw athang mawlaezung po a cyi hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Silawnaw he athang te, siapharan te a kya um hae paw balyn nynh bakhung hae zah a beik hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan te bawi hae nynh Levi phin hae kha David bya te profeh Asaf bya khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hlawsahte thehoysah lan kaw a pya hae. Lungpawte thehoysahnaw hlaw kha sah biate bakhung hae zah a beik hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Te Hezekiah nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan nanning nynh atu na thyaasaku vae oh; rang oh lah, silawnawpaw hae te lungtuanaw silawnawpaw hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang oun thuakhae oh,” a cipya hae. Ccungccaw zapi hae nynh silawnawpaw hae te lungtuanaw silawnawpaw hae kha a thuakhae hae; mih lungthopaw balyn nynh maee-ute silawnawpaw kha a thuakhae hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi hae nynh a thuakhae hae paw maee-ute silawnawpaw hae tuh tangnuapaw sung sari, tuutepaw za kheit te tuutaw za ning nynh thua; e hae balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan maee-ute silawnaw lanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Thyaasahpaw silawnawpaw hae tuh tangnuapaw za taruh te tuu thong thum nynh thua. <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuasalama ranpibawi hae tuh eih azya hae keiccuze maee-ute silawnawpaw balyn kha aphua lae kou khyh hae, tukeiccuze ccangpaw ranpibawi hae nynh a thyaasaku mawlaezung hae, mih uno Levi phin hae nynh rya athang makhia a bawm hae—pawccecize Levi phin hae tuh mimaw te mimaw thyaasahkunaw kya ranpibawi hae laeze mih thinlung adinghua. <verse number="35" style="v" />Maee-ute silawnawpaw hae patae apiaze ccawkunaw silawnaw hanlan atho te maee-ute silawnaw hanlan niapaw silawnaw hae kha a um hae. Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e ryalawnaw kha a umsah thui hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh ccungccaw hae hanlan a cyipya hae keiccuze Hezekiah te ccungccaw balyn tuh mih lungpaw; pawccecize tuh-e ryalaw tuh arangte acyihkuh.</para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Myarya Lepaw Kawtaw Poi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia hanlan kawtaw poi tua khylan Jerusalem umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kalan oun ccia ccaw hae cite Hezekiah nynh Israel ram te Judah ram kalan ccungccaw saw hae zah Efraim phin te Manasseh phin hae kalan mah ccaw a ky hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize siapharan te a kuihkaw e bawi hae te Jerusalem kya a pumkuh hae paw balyn nynh kawtaw poi tuh sawpaw sah ningnaw kya tua lante bya a pae vae hae, <verse number="3" style="v" />(pawccecize ranpibawi hae tuh milu phe zaw lan thyaasakuh loh khyh hae zah ccungccaw hae mah Jerusalem kya a pumku loh khyh hae keiccuze tuh-e poi tuh amaw accyh kya tua kho khyh hae).<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30.2-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:9-11">Nam 9.9-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan te a pumkuh hae paw balyn nynh tuh-e khuakhannaw tuh akyh cite a tua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel ram pynpi, Beersheba kyate Dan kyacia um hae paw ccungccaw hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kalan Jerusalem kya thuate kawtaw poi tua khylan thaesah lan kaw a tho hae; pawccecize phungbya kya azeiku thyhte ccungccaw patae te poi tua khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccaw phutu hae tuh siapharan te a kuihkaw e a bawi hae kya-e ccaw kha phute Israel te Judah ram pynpi kalan khe siapharan nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte a cceih hae, tuh-e ccaw kyatuin, “Pou Israel ccungccaw hae, Abraham, Isak te Israel Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan kithui oh lah, Assiria siapharan hae kuih kyate a lue hae paw nanning a laehy hae paw kalan khe aning tuh bua yn maekuh cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia tungvaw lungzinaw hoi lei hae paw nae minpaaw hae te nae puizia hae te lokuh nan oh, na muih oh hawte aning nynh minmin kha thawte de a tah hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae hawte nae lungkhung nan sah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan pyakuh oh, zungzae a thyaasahpaw a beikinnthyaa kalan oun cceih oh, te myarya lepaw a thinrianaw tuh nae kyate a maeku nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia rya kha lah oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan na kithui oh zetuh nae puizia hae te nae ccaaw hae tuh a kyngtu hae kya ngaethyaumsahnaw a mue cih hae zah, e ram lang oun ki cih hae. Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh ngaethyaumsah thyapaw te thawccih thyapaw thua zah, amaw kalan na kithui oh ze a mae kha ccanglang ae hawitaw lan khyh oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccaw phutu hae tuh Efraim te Manasseh ram po lekuh lan Zebulun ram cia khua kheit koute khua kheit a cceih hae; thuasalama minmin nynh nuinse hae zah a sarya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Asher phin, Manasseh phin te Zebulun phin kya-e ccungccaw beihtaraw kyalya nynh zakawsangsakuh hae zah Jerusalem lang a cceih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte siapharan te a kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh kaw a pya hae paw kha cyi khylan lungngingnaw thinlung pya khylan Judah hae kya Pachia thungnaw a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sawpaw sah ningnaw khe ransi phingkuh leipaw sanlou poi kha tua khylan ccungccaw patae tuh Jerusalem kya oun thua hae zah, a pumkuh hae paw tuh myarya alung hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin nynh rya kha tho hae zah Jerusalem kya a umpaw silawhang hae kha a nue hae, mynkhuhpaw unawpaw silawhang balyn kha lah hae zah Kidron Vaw kalan a vua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Sawpaw sah ningnaw nin haw lae pali nin khe kawtaw poi tuutaw kha a chia hae. Ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae tuh mih maethah zah mimaw toulou kha thyaasakuh hae zah maee-ute silawnaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang a teekhae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw Moses kawbya thyhte minmin nynh mih ummaenaw hmin kya a um hae; ranpibawi hae nynh Levi phin hae kuih kya-e a lawku hae paw chiise kha a hei hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize a pumkuh hae paw kyakhe a thyaasakuh lei hae paw patae a um hae; tukeiccuze a thyaa leipaw miakaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan thyaasah nawlan kawtaw poi tuutaw kha Levi phin hae nynh a chia hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize Efraim phin, Manasseh phin, Issakhar phin te Zebulun phin kya-e ccungccaw patae tuh phungbya kya azeiku thyhte mimaw kha thyaasaku leite kawtaw poi kya a aebua hae. Thuasalama Hezekiah nynh minmin hanlan sawsang zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />“Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih minpaaw hae Pachia kha mih thinlung ccaccing te ccung lan a paccynkuh hae paw tuh beikinnthyaa kya-e thyaasahkunaw phung thyhte a thyaa khyh hae zemah ahoypaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih balynte ngaethya vae hae sah,” a ci. <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Hezekiah kha thaepah zah ccungccaw hae kha a dansah hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem kya um hae paw Israel hae nynh ransi phing leipaw sanlou poi kha nin sari lungkhu myarya lungpawte a tua hae; Levi phin hae te ranpibawi hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan khuakupaw accaepaw uccaw hae kha khuakute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha nin takyh the a hoysah hae. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalawnaw kya mih thyanaw ahoypaw a langsah hae paw Levi phin hae balyn kha Hezekiah nynh thawpyanaw bya a hopya hae. Tuhcite ccungccaw hae nynh poi kya-e looh kha nin sari lungkhu ae hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih minpaaw hae Pachia kalan khe ccawkunaw silawnaw kha raete the a hoysah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Te a pumkuh hae paw balyn nynh poi kha nin sari bua tuachih lan mih nawccaw; tukeiccuze lungtuanaw te nin sari poi a tua ung hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize Judah siapharan Hezekiah nynh tangnuapaw thong kheit te tuu thong sari kha silawnaw rae nawlan a pya hae, te bawi hae nynh a pumkuh hae paw kha tangnuapaw thong kheit te tuu thong haw a pya hae. Ranpibawi hae patae nynh mimaw te mimaw kha a thyaasaku hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae ryte Judah hae a pumkuh hae paw balyn, te Israel ram kyate oun thua hae paw a pumkuh hae paw balyn, Israel ram kyate oun thua hae paw ramccang hae, Judah ram kya um hae paw ramccang hae balyn tuh mih lungpaw. <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel siapharan David ccapaw Solomon she koute Jerusalem kya hynhcihawpaw a um vae khyh keiccuze Jerusalem kya myarya lepaw lungpawnaw a um. <verse number="27" style="v" />Te ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae nynh thadyn hae zah ccungccaw hae kha hythuanaw pya hae zah mih roi thae athua; mih sawsangnaw tuh vaawlang khua e a umnaw hmin thyaapaw kya a thua.</para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh hae Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E hae balyn he athang te, tuin kya um hae paw Israel hae balyn tuh Judah ram e khua hae kalan cceih hae zah zohtuh hae kha roh hae zah Asherah khozinung hae kha a nge hae, te Judah ram, Benjamin ram, Efraim ram te Manasseh ram balyn kya umpaw ahangpaw hmin hae te silawhang hae kha marya a ro mawlaezung hae a nge hae. Te Israel ccungccaw hae balyn tuh mimaw khua lang, mih inn mih loo raveih lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae kha aphuphute a phia hae, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae kha mimaw rya raveih thyhte maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw hanlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryahmin sakoih kya ryalaw lan te lungtuanaw byahote thehoysah khylan rya a khang hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Siapharan nynh maee-ute silawnaw hanlan amaw a uccaw kya-e a hlupaw tuh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phungbya kya azeiku thyhte, awkhua takyhte zete takyh kya raepaw maee-ute silawnaw, sabbath nin hae, sawpaw thawpaw hae te accyh khyapaw poi hae kya maee-ute silawnawpaw hae kha nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:1-29:39">Nam 28.1—29.39</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phungbya kyakhe a pyaku kho nawlan hae, mih hanpaw ahlu kha na pya cih oh cite siapharan nynh Jerusalem khua um hae paw kha kaw a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31.4-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:12-13">Nam 18.12-13</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 18:21">21</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e bya tuh he a thae takaw hae te, Israel ccungccaw hae nynh ccathae, misutui, chitui, khoitui te looh kyate apoupaw miakaw kya-e thaety patae kha a pya hae; atyn-are kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha patae a ccyng hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah ram e khua hae kya um hae paw Israel hae te Judah hae nynh vaetua te tuu kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kalan a hlu hae paw athyaapaw uccaw hae kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha thuasah oun thuakhae hae zah aphuphute a pum hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Sawpaw sah thumnaw khe pum takaw hae zah sawpaw sah sarinaw khe a thangsah hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekiah te a kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh oun thua hae zah tuh-e a pum hae paw kha a muih hae tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te a ccungccaw Israel hae kha the a hoysah hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae kha tuh-e apumkuhpaw kong tuh a khia hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Zadok ciihan athuapaw ranpibawi lepaw Azariah nynh amaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang ahlu he a thuakhae takaw hae te, kaening tuh ae lanpaw phe zaw lan kae hoi zah alaepaw patae kae hoi ung; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw hae kha hythua a pya hae keiccuze alaepaw patae kae hoi,” cite a hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh Hezekiah nynh minmin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu kya sisuakhaan hae kha paccyn lan kawpya hae zah minmin nynh a paccyn hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin nynh ahlu, pumhaw pumkheit te hlupaw uccaw hae kha lungzite a teekhae hae. Tuh-e hae a do-oihtu bawi lepaw tuh Levi phin Konaniah thua zah a neitaw Shimei tuh lu ningnaw nynh thua; <verse number="13" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan te Pachia inn uktu bawi lepaw Azariah nynh rya a pya hae thyhte Jehiel, Azaziah, Nahath, Asahel, Jerimoth, Jozabad, Eliel, Ismakhiah, Mahath te Benaiah tuh Konaniah te a neitaw Shimei kha rya bawmte a do-oihtu hae nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi phin Imnah ccapaw Kore, nithua lang e sakoih ngawtu tuh Pachia kalan lungthote silawnawpaw lasung kha a do-oihtu thua zah, aning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan hlupaw ahlu te athyaa huaccepaw ahlu hae kha a neetu nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae kya-e khua hae kyakhe mih puizia hae kha imua piccan phe lokuh lante aphuphute mih hanpaw raveih kha nee khylan Eden, Miniamin, Jeshua, Shemaiah, Amariah te Shekaniah nynh Kore kha lungzite rya a bawm hae; <verse number="16" style="v" />mih thokeinaw ccazing thyhte kum thum te palung lang pise hae, mih ryalaw thyhte mih phu raveihte nin takyh a law hae paw ryalaw thyhte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang a teepaw miakaw kha tuh neebua khyh hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae mih min ccazing tuh mih puizia raveihte a law hae; Levi phin kum kuin te palung lang kha tuh mih ryalaw te mih phu raveih thyhte min ccazing a law hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae kha mih ccaaw taraw hae balyn ryte, mih zu hae, mih ccapaw hae, mih ccanung hae, mih balyn mawte min ccazing law athua hae; pawccecize minmin tuh lungzite mimaw te mimaw kha a thyaasaku hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Aaron ciihan ranpibawi hae kya-e khua hae te mih loram hae kya a um hae paw kyakhe mih hanpaw a neetu lang mih min te ryalaw khang athua hae paw ccungccaw hae um hae zah, tuh-e hae nynh ranpibawi hae laku e pise miakaw te min ccazing law athuapaw Levi phin miakaw kha a nee hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh Judah ram balyn kya tuhcite a cyi; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia malang khe ahoypaw, ahmepaw te lungzipaw rya kha a law. <verse number="21" style="v" />A Pachia kha ccung khylan Pachia inn e rya kya thuasah, phungbya te kawbya hae zuinaw kya thuasah rya a lawpaw miakaw kha a thinlung balyn te lah zah, a laan a sui a ua.</para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sennakherib nynh A Tuk hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-37">2Si 18.13-37</ref>, 19.14-19, 35-37; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Isa 36.1-22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 37:8-38">37.8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E hae balyn hynh Hezekiah nynh lungzinaw te rya a lah koute Assiria siapharan Sennakherib nynh Judah ram kha tuk lan a ccianua, akoihkuhpaw khua hae kha ryahmin tahnuakuh hae zah ka tae cih hae cite a tuaku. <verse number="2" style="v" />Sennakherib tuh yn cceih zah Jerusalem kha tuk lan a paccynku cipaw Hezekiah nynh he a muih tuh, <verse number="3" style="v" />khua atolang umpaw tuidy hae aluapaw kha pheih lan cite a kuihkaw e bawi hae te rhawkaw hae ryte a paccyn hae; minmin nynh amaw kha a bawm hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae kha pum hae zah ram lungkhu po aluapaw tuidy hae te vaw taraw hae kha pheih hae zah, “Pawccemou Assiria siapharan hae nynh oun cceih cih hae zah tui patae kha a muihkuh cih hae?” a ci hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh ryalaw lan tynkaring lan tuakuh zah khualungrua atingpaw balyn kha raethui zah a vawlan khe rhawvianaw innhangpaw hae kha a sak, atolang khe ccangpaw khualungrua kha a rae; David khua khe Millo kha sihkakin lan a rae, te zunghe hae te khawriaphua hae kha patae a rae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae kyakhe rhawtuknaw te asekuhpaw rhawbawi hae kha khang hae zah, khua koikua kya umpaw laanluepi kyakhe amaw kalan a pum hae. Te thawzung pyanaw bya hopah hae zah, <verse number="7" style="v" />“Nae thawsaesakuh oh lah, nae rawthungsakuh oh. Assiria siapharan te a kya umpaw zapi hae balyn kha rih nan oh, nae bungzou nan sah; pawccecize aning kalan a pankhaepaw laeze aening kalan oun pankhaepaw tuh a thawsaehua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aning kya a umpaw tuh ccungccaw thungnaw nynh thua; thuasalama aening kya tuh aening bawm khylan te rhaw tukpya khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia a um,” a cipya hae. Judah siapharan Hezekiah bya liate ccungccaw hae tuh thawzung a mue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />E koute, Assiria siapharan Sennakherib te a rhawkaw hae balyn tuh Lakhish khua kya a um lya hae khe, Jerusalem kya umpaw Judah siapharan Hezekiah te Judah hae balyn kalan khe aning nynh a ryalahtu hae kha saw hae zah, <verse number="10" style="v" />“Assiria siapharan Sennakherib nynh hynhte a ho: Jerusalem khua lungkhu kya koihluku khylan nanning nynh pawmou na doliaku oh? <verse number="11" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia nynh Assiria siapharan kuih kyate oun khum cih,’ cite ae hopah oh zah, nanning kha ccakannaw, tui kanmawnaw te chinaw kalan pyate ae cciakhaesei khyh oh tou? <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahangpaw a hmin hae te a silawhang hae kha vua hae zah, Judah te Jerusalem kha, ‘Silawhang ccangkheit malang khe na beik cih oh zah, tuh-e vawlan khe nae kya-e mynkhuhpaw kha na u cih oh,’ cite kaw ae pya oh zah ae hopah oh paw tuh khah-e Hezekiah maw kha thua khyh tou? <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae te ka minpaaw hae nynh ccangpaw ram hae kya-e ccungccaw hae balyn kha pawtemou kae cyi hae cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? Ccangpaw ram hae kya um hae paw minphuin hae kya-e pachia hae nynh mih ram kha ka kuih kyate a khum kho hae tou? <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka minpaaw hae nynh marya a ro hae paw ram hae kya-e pachia hae balyn kyaze a ccungccaw hae kha ka kuih kyate a khum kho hae paw pachia a um tou? Nae Pachia nynh nanning kha ka kuih kyate pawtemou ae khum kho cih oh? <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Hezekiah kha lingsakuh nan oh lah, tuhcite cciakhae seisakuh nan oh, aning kha zyn nan oh, pawccecize pawpaw minphuin pachia thuasah, pawpaw ram pachia thuasah a ccungccaw hae kha ka minpaaw hae kuih kyate thuasah, kamaw kuih kyate thuasah khum kho khyh hae. Nanning Pachia thathy nynh tuh pawtemou ka kuih kyate ae khum kho cih oh!” cite bya a taw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ryalahtu hae nynh Bawipaw PACHIA te a ryalahtu Hezekiah kha rawsete bya houh a ho hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tungvaw rawsenaw byahote theihryanaw ccaw kha mah zei zah, “Ccangpaw ram hae kya um hae paw minphuin hae kya-e pachia hae nynh mih ccungccaw hae kha ka kuih kyate a luesah khyh hae hawte, Hezekiah Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae kha ka kuih kyate luesah lan khyh hae,” a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />Khualungrua vawlan um hae paw Jerusalem khua e ccungccaw hae kha hurawte mih thinphangsah te khua kha law khylan, Judah bya te tuh-e tuh myarya ccae lan a siakhae hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Laephi vawlan e ccangpaw minphuin hae kya-e, ccungccaw kuih te raepaw pachia hae hawkhate Jerusalem Pachia kong kha a ho hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sennakherib Shungnaw te Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />E kong keiccuze Hezekiah Siapharan te Amoz ccapaw profeh Isaiah tuh sawsang hae zah vaawlang khe a sia hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh vaawpaw lu kheit kha saw zah, tuh-e paw nynh Assiria siapharan ryahmin kya um hae paw athungpaw rhawkaw hae, rhawbawi hae te bawi hae balyn kha a chia hae. Tukeiccuze maethyate amaw ram lang a ki. A pachia inn lungkhu lang he a tee tuh, amaw a ccapaw hae abang nynh amaw kha thaloi te a chia hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Hezekiah te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha Assiria siapharan Sennakherib kuih kyate thuasah, a rhawkaw hae balyn kuih kyate thuasah khum hae zah, pawpaw kya balyn daenaw a pya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae nynh Jerusalem khua langkhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan lasung ccyngpah hae zah Judah siapharan Hezekiah hanlan aphutepaw uccaw hae kha a ccyngpya hae, tuin ccyh kyate tho zah Hezekiah tuh minphuin hae balyn malang khe hangthung athua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah Ccinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(2Si 20.1-3, 12-19; <ref loc="ISA 38:1-3">Isa 38.1-3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">39.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuh lyatuin Hezekiah tuh ccih zah vyavya a chih. Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sawsang zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aphi pya zah syntawnaw a pya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama Hezekiah tuh a thinlung kya a lysaku keiccuze a tungvaw thanenaw a raepya thyhte a lungtuanaw langsakuh khyh. Tukeiccuze amaw tungvaw te Judah te Jerusalem tungvaw kya thinrianaw accah. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama Hezekiah nynh a thinlung kya a lysakupaw konglang te, amaw te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae nynh zakaw a sangsaku hae keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh minmin tungvaw kya Hezekiah she lungkhu ccah khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah Hoirumnaw te Phu-enaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2Si 20.12-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">Isa 39.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hezekiah tuh myarya hoirum zah phu-enaw a ccou; sui, ngun, aphutepaw lung hae, mynkhuhpaw hae, khawriaphua hae te amee rupaw sisua phuinccing nung nawlan sisuakhaan hae kha a raeku; <verse number="28" style="v" />looh, misutui te chitui nung nawlan ccung-inn hae kha a sak; sahiin phuinccing nung nawlan sahiinkhia hae te tuukhia hae kha a sak. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhawte amaw hanlan khua hae kha raekuh zah tuuphu hae te vaetua phu hae kha patae a hoi; pawccecize Pachia nynh hoirumnaw patae a pya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Hezekiah amaw ccaccei nynh Gihon tui tuh palung lang apounaw kha ping zah David khua niccaw langkhe a luasah bung. Hezekiah tuh a ryalaw miakaw kya a laan a sui a ua. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ram lungkhu kya cyihkuh zah ngaeangthua lan umpaw uccaw kong kha byakhiatua khylan Babilon bawi hae nynh locceihtu hae oun saw hae paw kong kya mah, Hezekiah kha syntawtua khylan te a thinlung kya umpaw balyn kha ny khylan Pachia nynh Hezekiah kha a sawbia.</para>
  <para style="s">Hezekiah Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:20-21">2Si 20.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Hezekiah nynh a cyipaw te hoynaw a raepaw kha tuh Judah te Israel Siapharan hae Ccauh lungkhu, Amoz ccapaw profeh Isaiah nynh a muihpaw vizin kyakhe a zei hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Hezekiah tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, David ciihan hae shawku palung langkhe a uu hae; he a chih tuh, Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn nynh sawtuanaw a pya hae. A ccapaw Manasseh nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Manasseh nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:1-9">2Si 21.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh tuh kum haw lae ning acih te ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya sung pangaw kum pangaw a uk. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel ccungccaw hae malang te a dee hae paw minphuin hae nynh a cyi hae paw anungsikuhpaw phunglang kha zuite, aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:4">Jer 15.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />A paaw Hezekiah nynh a la ropaw ahangpaw hmin hae kha a raethui; Baal elang silawhang hae kha raepah zah Asherah kha mah a rae, vaawlui kya umpaw uccaw hae balyn kha beik zah rya a lawpya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Jerusalem khua kya ka min tuh zungzae a um cih,” cite a la ci nuathepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyakhe ccangpaw pachia hae kya-e silawhang hae kha a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:6">2Sh 6.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn voidu ccangning kyakhe vaawlui kya umpaw uccaw hae balyn hanlan silawhang hae kha a rae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinnom ccapaw accya kyakhe a ccapaw kha silaw nawlan maee te a u; beidinhonaw, kuihdokunaw te naawthyanaw kha mang zah, chihiinleihthya hae paw te mitleihthya hae paw kha mah a mang hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw patae kha rae zah a thin a riasah. <verse number="7-8" style="v" />Pachia nynh David te a ccapaw Solomon kyakhe, “Israel phin hae balyn kyate ka popaw Jerusalem khua kya te hynh-e inn kyahin ka min kha zungzae ka tynsah cih; kaw ka pya hae paw balyn, Moses kyate ka pya hae paw phungbya, phunglang hae te phungzae hae balyn thyhte minmin nynh cyi lan a raeringku hae zetuh, mih minpaaw hae ka pya hae paw ram kyate mih ccu kha ccanglang ka cciasah sei vae lan khyh,” cite a hopyanaw hae Pachia inn lungkhu khe amaw nynh karynte azuh soi zah a raepaw zohtuh kha a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33.7-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:3-5">1Si 9.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:12-18">2Sh 7.12-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasseh nynh Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha a cciakhaesei hae keiccuze Israel ccungccaw hae malang te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ro hae paw minphuin hae nynh a la cyi hae paw laeze hoyleinaw kha houh lung lan a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Manasseh A Ngaesikuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Manasseh te a ccungccaw hae kha a hopya hae zemah minmin nynh pawlangria khyh hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Assiria siapharan a rhawbawi hae kha mih kalan ccianua sah hae zah, minmin nynh Manasseh tuh kyng hae zah sivawrui te a khii hae, te Babilon lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Riathaenaw a teing lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia kalan thawccinaw kha ngiakuh zah, a minpaaw hae Pachia malang khe myaryamaw zakaw a sangsakuh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaw kalan sawsang zah, Pachia nynh a ngiapaw kha ccoupah zah a sawsangnaw kha a thaepya, te amaw ram lang Jerusalem langkhe bua a kikhae. Tetuh Manasseh nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Pachia ccaccing nynh thua cipaw a ny.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukoute David khua atolang, Gihon niccaw lang e accya kyakhe, Ngasaw Koikua teenaw kyacia khualungrua kha a rae; te tuh-e lungrua tuh Ofel kha po voilu lan rae zah myarya hangpaw lang a rae. Judah ram e akoihkuhpaw khua balyn kyakhe rhawbawi hae kha a nung hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ramccang pachia hae te zohtuh hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyate ccaring lah hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a umnaw mua vawlan te Jerusalem lungkhu a raepaw silawhang balyn kha khua atolang khe a vua hae. <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang kha mah bua nungthui zah a vawlan khe ccawkunaw silawnaw te lungtuanaw silawnaw hae kha a rae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia rya kha na lah cih oh cite Judah hae kha kaw a pya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh ahangpaw hmin hae kyakhe silawnaw a rae ung hae zemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kalan rou nynh silawnaw a rae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Manasseh Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:17-18">2Si 21.17-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Manasseh nynh rya a lawpaw, Pachia kalan saw a sangpaw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia min te profeh hae nynh amaw kalan a hopya hae paw bya hae tuh Israel Siapharan hae Phungpaw kya a um. <verse number="19" style="v" />A sawsangnaw, a ngiapaw kha Pachia nynh a ccoupyanaw, zakaw a sangsaku maw lyaze a seinaw balyn te a lungzi leinaw, ahangpaw hmin hae kha rae zah Asherah te zohtuh hae a nungnaw hmin hae kong kha tuh profeh hae phungpaw ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Manasseh tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah amaw inn khe a uu hae. A ccapaw Amon nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Amon Uknaw te Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:19-26">2Si 21.19-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amon tuh kum kuin lae ning acih te ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum ning a uk. <verse number="22" style="v" />A paaw Manasseh nynh a la rae hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. A paaw Manasseh nynh a la raepaw zohtuh hae balyn kalan khe Amon nynh silaw zah rya a lawpya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />A paaw Manasseh nynh zakaw a sangsaku hawte, aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang zakawsangsaku leite, e Amon nynh seinaw kha houhouh a rae. <verse number="24" style="v" />A ryalahtu hae nynh amaw kha phee hae zah a inn kya a chia hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama ramccungccaw hae nynh Siapharan Amon a pheetu hae balyn kha a chia hae; te ramccungccaw hae nynh a ccapaw Josiah kha amaw ccelang siapharan lang a khang hae.</para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Josiah Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 22:1-2">2Si 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah tuh kum tarya acih te ram kha uk takaw zah Jerusalem khua kya sung thum kum kheit a uk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:6">Jer 3.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha cyih zah a minpaaw David laanpi kha a zui, voilang ranglang maekuh khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize ram a uknaw kum taryanaw kum, ccangvae taraw athua lyakhe, a minpaaw David Pachia kha a ccung takaw; kum haw lae ning kum khe Judah te Jerusalem kya umpaw ahangpaw hmin hae, Asherim, karouhpaw zohtuh te laeepaw zohtuh hae kha a vua takaw. <verse number="4" style="v" />Baal silawhang hae kha a malang khe a ting hae; tuh-e vawlan a thadynpaw mynkhuhpaw unawpaw silawhang hae kha a ro hae. Asherim, karouhpaw zohtuh te laeepaw zohtuh hae kha bae zah zoihtatyh lan a koi koute tuh-e hae kalan silawnaw a la raetu hae shawku vawlan khe a hei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:3">2Si 21.3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:3">2Sh 33.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae ru kha mah mih silawhang hae vawlan khe maee te u zah, Judah te Jerusalem kha a thyaasah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">1Si 13.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Manasseh ram, Efraim ram, Simeon ram te Naftali ram kyacia a umpaw khua hae te mih pepan e arohpaw khua hae kyakhe tuhmaminte a cyi, <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel ram balyn kyakhe silawhang hae kha ting hae zah Asherim te zohtuh hae kha zoihtatyh lan a koi hae, te mynkhuhpaw unawpaw silawhang balyn kha a ro. Tukoute Jerusalem lang a ki.</para>
  <para style="s">Phungbya Ccauh Muihnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 22:3-20">2Si 22.3-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram a uknaw kum haw lae taryanaw kum khe ram te beikinn kha a thyaasah koute, Azaliah ccapaw Shafan, khua uktu Maaseiah te Joahaz ccapaw ccazing kyngtu Joah kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia inn raethui lan a saw hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh ranpibawi lupi Hilkiah kalan cceih hae zah, thuakaw ngawtu Levi phin hae nynh Manasseh phin hae, Efraim phin hae, Israel hae a laehy hae paw balyn, Judah phin hae te Benjamin phin hae balyn te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kya-e khoi hae zah Pachia inn lungkhu lang a la thuakhae hae paw phua kha a pya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a do-oih hae paw ryalahtu hae kha pya hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya ryalah hae paw nynh inn raethui nawlan te cyithui nawlan a pya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah siapharan hae nynh a rosah hae paw inn hae kha raethui nawlan lung adeihkuh vae paw te thingccaw kha re nawlan lehccama hae te inn saktu hae kalan tuh-e phua tuh a pya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh lungzite rya a law hae. Tuh-e hae a uktu lang Levi phin Merari ciihan hae Jahath te Obadiah, te Kohath ciihan hae Zekhariah te Meshullam kha ryalaw dopahtu lang a nung hae. Khuakupaw uccaw kha khuakute hlawsahthyapaw ccangpaw Levi phin hae balyn nynh, <verse number="13" style="v" />uccaw phutu hae te ryalaw aphuinphuin lahtu hae kha a uk hae; Levi phin hae abang tuh ccazi, bawi te sakoih ngawtu nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang a la nung hae paw phua kha a poukhae lya hae khe, Moses kyate pya athuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phungbya ccauh kha ranpibawi Hilkiah nynh a muih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Hilkiah nynh ryaccinkhan Shafan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya phungbya ccauh kha ka muih,” a cipya; te Hilkiah nynh ccauh kha Shafan kalan a pya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Shafan nynh ccauh kha siapharan kalan ccyng zah, “Na ryalahtu hae kalan cyi lan kaw na pya hae paw balyn kha minmin nynh a cyih cciamang hae. <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya a muih hae paw phua kha lah hae zah, rya a dopahtu hae te ryalahtu hae kha a pya hae,” cite siapharan kha a hopya chih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ryaccinkhan Shafan nynh siapharan kha, “Ranpibawi Hilkiah nynh ccauh yn pya,” cipah zah, Shafan nynh siapharan kha accae lante a riapya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siapharan nynh phungbya kya-e bya kha he a thae tuh a boeining kha a seii. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh Hilkiah, Safan ccapaw Ahikam, Mikah ccapaw Abdon, ryaccinkhan Shafan te siapharan ryalahtu Asaiah kha kawpya hae zah: <verse number="21" style="v" />“La cceih oh lah, kamaw hanlan te Israel ram te Judah ram kya a laehy hae paw hanlan, e ccauh lungkhu e bya te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha la khiatua oh; ah minpaaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha zui leite, e ccauh kya azeikuhpaw balyn thyhte a cyi khyh hae keiccuze aening tungvaw accahpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh myarya ale,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Profeh Huldah kha Tuanaw Ngianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Hilkiah te siapharan nynh a saw hae paw ccungccaw hae tuh profeh Huldah kalan cceih hae zah tuh-e konglang tuh a hopya hae; Huldah tuh boeining nungnaw a do-oihtu Hasrah ccapaw Tokhath a ccapaw Shallum zu nynh thua (Huldah tuh Jerusalem khua, Zakueh Ccangningnaw kya a umpaw nynh thua). <verse number="23" style="v" />Huldah nynh minmin kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Ka kalan nanning ae saw oh paw ccungccapaw kha la hopah oh, <verse number="24" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Judah siapharan malang ria athuapaw ccauh lungkhu e azeikuhpaw thyalawnaw balyn kha, e hmin te a lungkhu um hae paw balyn tungvaw kya ronaw kha ka thuasah ccaccing cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Kae kha yn vua hae zah, mih kuih te a raeku hae paw balyn khate ka thinriasah khylan, ccangpaw pachia hae kalan khe silawnaw a rae vae hae, tukeiccuze e hmin kya ka thinrianaw kha ka bu cih zah dae kho vae lan khyh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha byakhia khylan nanning ae sawtu oh paw Judah siapharan kha tuh hynhte na la hopah cih oh: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Na thaepaw bya konglang te, <verse number="27" style="v" />e hmin te hein kya um hae paw tungvaw kya rawsenaw bya ka hopaw kha he na thae te, na thinlung tuh ngaesikuh zah Pachia malang zakawsangsakute na boeining na seii zah ka malang na raw keiccuze kae nynh mah na bya kha kae thaepya vae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang tuh na minpaaw hae kya kae sueluabua cih zah daebabi lan shaw lungkhu na thua cih; e hmin te a lungkhu um hae paw kya ka thuasah cih paw ronaw balyn kha na mit nynh muih lan khyh, a ci cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. Tuh-e bya tuh minmin nynh siapharan kalan a kikhae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Byakinnaw Raethuinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:1-20">2Si 23.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh ccungccaw saw hae zah Judah te Jerusalem piccan hae balyn kha a pum hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Siapharan tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang cceihthung zah amaw ryte Judah ccungccaw hae balyn, Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae, ccungccaw adih ale balyn a cceihbua hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya a muih hae paw byakinnaw ccauh kya-e bya balyn kha a thaenaw hae khe a ria. <verse number="31" style="v" />Siapharan tuh amaw hmin kya thadyn zah, hynh-e ccauh lungkhu azeikuhpaw byakinnaw bya hae thyhte rae khylan, a thinlung balyn te, a hiinnaw balyn te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nulang zuiku khylan a kawbya hae, a phunglang hae te a phungbya hae kha zui lan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe byakinkunaw a rae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Te aning nynh Jerusalem khua te Benjamin ram kya um hae paw balyn kha tuh-e byakinnaw tuh bya a kinsaku hae. Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae nynh mih minpaaw hae Pachia, Pachia byakinnaw thyhte a cyi hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Josiah nynh anungsikuhpaw uccaw balyn kha Israel hae kya-e ram hae balyn kyate vua zah, Israel ram kya um hae paw balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia tuh a beiksah hae. Amaw she lungkhu tuh minmin nynh mih minpaaw hae Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> zuinaw kyate ccanglang maekuh khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Kawtaw Poi Tuanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:21-23">2Si 23.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan Jerusalem khua kya kawtaw poi kha a tua; masaty sawpaw nin haw lae pali nin khe kawtaw poi tuutaw kha a chia hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae kha mimaw rya raveih kya nung hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn ryalawnaw kyakhe thawzung a pya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel hae balyn kha ccangpah hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan athyaapaw Levi phin hae kha hopah hae zah, “Israel siapharan David ccapaw Solomon nynh a sakpaw inn lungkhu khe athyaapaw thingkua kha nung oh; nae raw te puih ho vae lan khyh. Atu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia te a ccungccaw Israel hae kha ryalawpah oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel siapharan David kya-e muihsahnaw te a ccapaw Solomon kya-e muihsahnaw kha zuite, nae puizia raveihte naemaw phu thyhte paccynkuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:14">2Sh 8.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Nae uno athuapaw zapi hae kyaze puizia raveihte phiapaw aphu thyhte athyaapaw hmin kyakhe um oh lah, nae puizia hae aphu raveih hanlan Levi phin hae kha umbua hae sah. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kawtaw poi tuutaw kha theih oh, naemaw kha thyaasakuh oh lah, Moses kyate oun pyapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte nae puizia hae ccelang paccyntua oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Josiah nynh ccungccaw hae a um hae paw balyn hanlan kawtaw poi silawnaw lang amaw a sahiin phu kya-e tuutaw hae te miaataw hae thong sung thum te tangnuapaw thong thum kha a hlu; e hae hynh siapharan amaw nynh a hoipaw nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />A kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh mimaw lungthote ccungccaw hae, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae hanlan a hlu hae. Pachia inn kya-e bawi lepaw hae Hilkiah, Zekhariah te Jehiel nynh ranpibawi hae kalan khe kawtaw poi silawnaw hanlan tuutaw te miaataw thong ning za taruh te tangnuapaw za thum kha a pya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi phin kya-e lupi hae Konaniah te a uno hae Shemaiah te Nethanel, Hashabiah, Jeiel te Jozabad nynh Levi phin lupi hae kalan khe kawtaw poi silawnaw hanlan tuutaw te miaataw thong pangaw te tangnuapaw za pangaw kha a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ryalawnaw kha he a paccyn kou hae te, siapharan nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte ranpibawi hae tuh mimaw hmin kya thadyn hae zah Levi phin hae tuh mimaw phu kya a thadyn hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawtaw poi tuutaw kha a chia hae, te ranpibawi hae nynh Levi phin hae kya-e a law hae paw sachii tuh a hei hae, tuh lyatuin Levi phin hae nynh aphua a lae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses ccauh kya azeiku thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hlu khylan, zapi hae kya-e puizia raveihte phiapaw aphu hae kha nee khylan, maee-ute silawnawpaw hae kha taekhiate a nung hae. Te tangnuapaw hae kha mah tuhmaminte a cyi hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Phungzae thyhte kawtaw poi tuutaw kha maee te a rua hae; athyaapaw silawnawpaw hae kha laephi ang, sivaw ang te ohkan khate thung hae zah ccungccaw balyn kalan arangte a nee hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:8-9">Exo 12.8-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukoute mimaw elang te ranpibawi hae elang a paccyn hae, pawccecize Aaron ciihan hae ranpibawi hae tuh maee-ute silawnaw te atho te silawnaw kha khuazi cia a rae hae; tukeiccuze Levi phin hae nynh mimaw elang te Aaron ciihan hae ranpibawi hae elang kha a paccyn hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />David, Asaf, Heman te siapharan a profeh Jeduthun nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte, hlawsahthya hae paw Asaf ciihan hae tuh mimaw hmin kya a um hae. Sakoih ngawtu hae tuh sakoih takyh kya a um hae; mih uno Levi phin hae nynh minmin elang a paccyn vae hae keiccuze mih ryalaw kha cciataw ho vae khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1">1Sh 25.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhcite Siapharan Josiah kya-e kawpyanaw thyhte, kawtaw poi tua khylan te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang vawlan maee-ute silawnaw rae khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalawnaw balyn kha tuin nin khe a paccyn hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuin kya umpaw Israel ccungccaw hae nynh tuin ccyh khe kawtaw poi kha tua hae zah ransi phing leipaw sanlou poi kha nin sari a tua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Exo 12.1-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Profeh Samuel she kyate tho zah tuh-e te alokuhpaw kawtaw poi kha Israel ram kya tua boi vae khyh hae; Josiah, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae, tuin kya umpaw Judah hae te Israel hae balyn te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae nynh a tua hae paw kawtaw poi tahawpaw tuh Israel siapharan humhung nynh mah tua boi khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Josiah nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae taryanaw kum khe e kawtaw poi hynh a tua hae.</para>
  <para style="s">Josiah Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:28-30">2Si 23.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />E hae balyn koute, Josiah nynh beikinn kha he a paccyn koute, Izip siapharan Neko nynh Zufrates vaw kin umpaw Karkhemish khua kha tuk lan a ccianua thung, te Josiah nynh Neko tuh a ccianua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Neko nynh a kalan khe locceihtu saw zah, “Judah siapharan, nang te kae tuh pawmou cyiku lanpaw a um? Atunin nang kha tuk lan kae ccianua khyh, kae te rhaw kae tukkuhpaw innbyn kha tuk khylan nynh kae ccia; Pachia nynh arangte cyi lan kaw yn pya. Ka kya a umpaw Pachia kha rawse leite zya umtua, tuhteze nynh nang kha ae roh lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama Josiah nynh ccanglang maetawku leite, aning te tukku khylan a muinsan a rulaeku. Pachia mung kyate apoupaw bya Neko bya kha ngae khyh zah Megiddo bialae kya rhawtukku lan a cceih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thekawthya hae paw nynh Siapharan Josiah kha a kaw hae; te siapharan nynh a ryalahtu hae kha, “Vaemaw myarya ccih lan ka mue vae keiccuze yn cciakhae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a ryalahtu hae nynh marangle kyate poukhae hae zah a marangle ccangningnaw kyakhe khang hae zah Jerusalem lang a cciakhae hae. Tuin kyakhe chih zah a minpaaw hae shawku kyakhe a uu hae. Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae balyn tuh Josiah hanlan a rah hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh mah Josiah kha rawkhuinaw hlawphua zah, hlawsahthyapaw pise hae te nopi hae balyn nynh Josiah kha atunin cia mih rawkhuinaw hlaw kya a mang hae. E hynh Israel phungzae lang a mang hae; Rawnaw Hlaw kya a zei hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Josiah nynh rya a lawpaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phungbya kya azeiku thyhte lungzite a cyipaw, <verse number="27" style="v" />a ryalawnaw atakaw te athangnaw cia Israel te Judah Siapharan hae Ccauh kya a zei hae.</para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="s">Jehoahaz Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:30-35">2Si 23.30-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ram lungkhu e ccungccaw hae nynh Josiah ccapaw Jehoahaz kha ko hae zah Jerusalem kya a paaw ccelang siapharan lang a khang hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jehoahaz tuh kum kuin lae thum acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah Jerusalem kya sawpaw sah thum a uk. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Izip siapharan nynh Jerusalem kya amaw kha phoh zah, ram kya ngun talent za kheit te sui talent ccangkheit kha ngunto lang a ngia. <verse number="4" style="v" />A upaw Eliakim kha Izip siapharan nynh Judah ram te Jerusalem a uktu siapharan lang khang zah a min kha Jehoiakim cite a paleih; a neitaw Jehoahaz kha tuh Neko nynh Izip ram lang a cciakhae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:11-12">Jer 22.11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiakim Uknaw te Kyngnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:36-24:7">2Si 23.36—24.7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakim tuh kum kuin lae pangaw acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum haw lae kheit a uk. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:18-19">Jer 22.18-19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 26:1-6">26.1-6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 35:1-19">35.1-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh ccianua thung zah, Babilon lang cciakhae khylan sivawrui te a khii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:1-38">Jer 25.1-38</ref>, <ref loc="JER 36:1-32">36.1-32</ref>, <ref loc="JER 45:1-5">45.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1-2">Dan 1.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya-e angphe abang kha mah Nebukhadnezzar nynh Babilon lang cciakhae zah Babilon khua e a siapharan inn khe a nung. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jehoiakim nynh rya a lawpaw, anungsikuhpaw a la cyipaw te ahoy leipaw a cyisahnaw kha Israel te Judah Siapharan hae Ccauh kya a zei hae; a ccapaw Jehoiakhin nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiakhin A Uknaw te Kyngnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:8-11">2Si 24.8-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jehoiakhin tuh kum tarya acih te ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya sawpaw sah thum te nin haw a uk. Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e kum hawnin khe Nebukhadnezzar Siapharan nynh ccungccaw saw hae zah amaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e aphutepaw angphe hae ryte Babilon lang a cciakhae, te Jehoiakhin a unopaw Zedekiah kha Judah ram te Jerusalem a uktu siapharan lang a khang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:24-30">Jer 22.24-30</ref>, <ref loc="JER 24:1-10">24.1-10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 29:1-2">29.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 37:1">37.1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:12">Eze 17.12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 17:13">13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Zedekiah Uknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2Si 24.18-20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1-3a">Jer 52.1-3a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zedekiah tuh kum kuin lae kheit acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem kya kum haw lae kheit a uk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:1-22">Jer 27.1-22</ref>, <ref loc="JER 28:1-17">28.1-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mung kyate apoupaw bya a hotupaw Jeremiah malang kya zakawsangsakuh khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pachia min phyate bya a kinkuhpaw Nebukhadnezzar Siapharan kha mah a dou; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kalan maeleihkuh ry khyh zah a lungkhungsakuh zah a thinlung a tansaku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:15">Eze 17.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae kyaze alehua hae paw te ccungccaw hae balyn tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae kya-e anungsikuhpaw balyn kha zuibua hae zah myaryamaw mih lungzi khyh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jerusalem kya a thyaasahpaw a inn kha a thusah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Shungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, mih minpaaw hae Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae te a umnaw hmin kha ngaethya a umsah keiccuze a locceihtu hae kha apaekuh lei lan a sawnua hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama a ccungccaw hae tungvaw accahpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh myarya le zah adae kho lei lan ciate minmin nynh Pachia locceihtu hae kha a sarya hae, a bya kha pawlangria khyh hae zah a profeh hae kha a theihrya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning nynh Babilon hae siapharan kha minmin kalan ccianua sah hae zah, tuh-e paw nynh mih ccangvae hae kha mih beikinnthyaa kyakhe thaloi te a chia hae; ccangvae, liaccaw, kum tang hae paw te thawzya hae paw kha ngaethyaumsah khyh hae; Pachia nynh mih balyn mawte tuh-e siapharan kuih kalan a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:1-10">Jer 21.1-10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 34:1-5">34.1-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Pachia inn e angphe adih alepaw balyn, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e sisua hae, siapharan te a kuihkaw e bawi hae kya-e sisua hae, e hae balyn hynh Babilon lang a cciakhae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pachia inn kha maee te a soi hae, Jerusalem khualungrua kha ting hae zah a siapharan inn balyn kha maee te a soi hae, te khua kya-e aphutepaw uccaw balyn kha a ro hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thaloi kyate a lue hae paw kha kyngte Babilon lang cciakhae hae zah, Persia peenaw atyn mawlaezung minmin kha amaw te a ccapaw hae see lang a tang hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />E hynh, Israel ram nynh a sabbath nin hae kha a lungpawsah mawlaezung, cite Jeremiah nynh a hopaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha accing nawlan nynh thua. Tuh-e ram nynh ccungccaw adae ccyh balyn, kum sung sari phe ccing lan sabbath kha a sung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Jer 25.11</ref>, <ref loc="JER 29:10">29.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Sairas nynh Luenaw Kong A Thaesah hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZR 1:1-4">Ezr 1.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jeremiah nynh a hopaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ccingsah khylan, Persia siapharan Sairas nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw masaty kum khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Persia siapharan Sairas thinlung kha a tuhou keiccuze aning nynh a peenaw balyn kalan kaw a thopaw ccaw kha kyte thaesah hae zah: <verse number="23" style="v" />“Persia siapharan Sairas nynh hynhte a ho: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, vaaw Pachia nynh laephi peenaw balyn kha yn pya vae zah, Judah ram Jerusalem khua kya amaw hanlan inn sakpya lan kae kha yn naw. Tukeiccuze Pachia ccungccaw athuapaw miakaw nanning balyn tuh tuhlang tuin la cceihthung oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh nae kya la um vae sah!” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:28">Isa 44.28</ref></char></note></para>
</usx>